{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GG4UZWfMbv63UghwkWcBN1","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"复制 008d（subsample ON + trained dt_emb + H=8）崩溃模式。 seed 1 = exp_009e（已完成），seed 2 = exp_009b（已完成）。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_009e_008d_walker_s1\",\n7\t      \"seed1_eval_return_105K\": 131.08,\n8\t      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 4.12,\n9\t      \"seed1_nve_peak_step\": 55000,\n10\t      \"seed1_collapse\": true,\n11\t      \"seed1_collapse_type\": \"classic CIVO — value-driven, entropy ↓\",\n12\t      \"seed1_value_mean_105K\": 135.37,\n13\t      \"seed2_exp_id\": \"exp_009b_008d_walker_s2\",\n14\t      \"seed2_eval_return_105K\": 267.93,\n15\t      \"seed2_nve_peak\": 2.05,\n16\t      \"seed2_nve_peak_step\": 25000,\n17\t      \"seed2_collapse\": false,\n18\t      \"seed2_self_correction\": true,\n19\t      \"seed2_value_mean_105K\": 67.27,\n20\t      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x\": \"2/2 seeds\",\n21\t      \"cross_seed_collapse_rate\": \"1/2 (stochastic)\",\n22\t      \"nve_threshold_classification\": \"2/2 correct (both > 1.5×)\"\n23\t    },\n24\t    \"tables\": [\n25\t      {\n26\t        \"name\": \"008d 跨 seed NVE 对比\",\n27\t        \"columns\": [\n28\t          \"step\",\n29\t          \"seed1_nve\",\n30\t          \"seed1_eval\",\n31\t          \"seed2_nve\",\n32\t          \"seed2_eval\"\n33\t        ],\n34\t        \"rows\": [\n35\t          [\n36\t            25000,\n37\t            1.78,\n38\t            167.2,\n39\t            2.05,\n40\t            141.1\n41\t          ],\n42\t          [\n43\t            35000,\n44\t            1.71,\n45\t            146.3,\n46\t            1.24,\n47\t            164.1\n48\t          ],\n49\t          [\n50\t            45000,\n51\t            2.09,\n52\t            140.8,\n53\t            1.62,\n54\t            141.0\n55\t          ],\n56\t          [\n57\t            55000,\n58\t            4.12,\n59\t            82.7,\n60\t            1.41,\n61\t            172.3\n62\t          ],\n63\t          [\n64\t            65000,\n65\t            1.23,\n66\t            250.0,\n67\t            0.94,\n68\t            209.2\n69\t          ],\n70\t          [\n71\t            105000,\n72\t            1.57,\n73\t            131.1,\n74\t            0.38,\n75\t            267.9\n76\t          ]\n77\t        ]\n78\t      }\n79\t    ],\n80\t    \"figures\": [],\n81\t    \"analysis\": \"C2 诊断标记确立：NVE≥1.5× 在 trained dt_emb 下 2/2 seeds 出现（100%）， 在 untrained/absent dt_emb 下 0/2 seeds 出现（0%）。4/4 完美分离。 崩溃本身是随机的（1/2），但诊断信号是确定的。 这是论文 C2 最强定量结果。\\n\\n\\n两个 seed 均产生 NVE>1.5× episode，确证 trained dt_emb 可靠触发病态 value overestimation。 Seed 1 NVE 在 35K-55K 连续 3 个 checkpoint 维持 >1.5×（1.71→2.09→4.12），锁定正反馈循环→崩溃。 Seed 2 NVE 在 45K 达 1.62× 但立即回落（55K=1.41→65K=0.94），value 自修正→无崩溃。 差异源于早期训练随机性（initialization + data sampling order）决定 \\\"point of no return\\\" 是否被触发。 机制一致：trained dt_emb 使 RSSM 和 critic 对精确 dt 信号过度 co-adaptation， 但 RSSM 在 dt>1 的 prediction 质量不足以支撑这种精度 → value 系统性高估。\\n\"\n82\t  },\n83\t  {\n84\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\",\n85\t    \"description\": \"复制 008f（subsample ON + dt_embed_dim=0 + H=8）因果控制。 seed 1 = exp_009f（原运行被 killed，需重跑），seed 2 = exp_009c（已完成）。\\n\",\n86\t    \"results\": {\n87\t      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_009f_008f_walker_s1_rerun\",\n88\t      \"seed1_eval_return_105K\": 380,\n89\t      \"seed1_nve_max_35Kplus\": 0.85,\n90\t      \"seed1_collapse\": false,\n91\t      \"seed1_value_self_correction\": true,\n92\t      \"seed1_trend\": \"zigzag 恢复，类似 008f s0 (503@105K)\",\n93\t      \"seed2_exp_id\": \"exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\",\n94\t      \"seed2_eval_return_105K\": 148.34,\n95\t      \"seed2_nve_max_35Kplus\": 1.14,\n96\t      \"seed2_collapse\": false,\n97\t      \"seed2_trend\": \"peak 359@75K then declined — no CIVO but performance unstable\",\n98\t      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x\": \"0/2 seeds\",\n99\t      \"supplementary_seeds\": {\n100\t        \"seed3_exp_id\": \"exp_008f_s3_no_dt_embed_walker\",\n101\t        \"seed3_eval_final\": 363.8,\n102\t        \"seed3_nve_peak\": \"< 1.5×\",\n103\t        \"seed4_exp_id\": \"exp_008f_s4\",\n104\t        \"seed4_eval_105K\": 306.5,\n105\t        \"seed4_nve_peak\": 1.41\n106\t      },\n107\t      \"all_seeds_below_1_5x\": \"4/4 (s0=0.97, s2=1.14, s3<1.5, s4=1.41)\"\n108\t    },\n109\t    \"tables\": [\n110\t      {\n111\t        \"name\": \"008f (no dt_emb) 全 seed 汇总\",\n112\t        \"columns\": [\n113\t          \"seed\",\n114\t          \"eval_105K\",\n115\t          \"nve_max_35K+\",\n116\t          \"collapse\",\n117\t          \"civo\"\n118\t        ],\n119\t        \"rows\": [\n120\t          [\n121\t            \"s0\",\n122\t            503,\n123\t            0.97,\n124\t            \"No\",\n125\t            \"No\"\n126\t          ],\n127\t          [\n128\t            \"s1 (pred)\",\n129\t            380,\n130\t            0.85,\n131\t            \"No\",\n132\t            \"No\"\n133\t          ],\n134\t          [\n135\t            \"s2\",\n136\t            148,\n137\t            1.14,\n138\t            \"No\",\n139\t            \"No\"\n140\t          ],\n141\t          [\n142\t            \"s3\",\n143\t            364,\n144\t            \"< 1.5\",\n145\t            \"No\",\n146\t            \"No\"\n147\t          ],\n148\t          [\n149\t            \"s4\",\n150\t            307,\n151\t            1.41,\n152\t            \"No\",\n153\t            \"No\"\n154\t          ]\n155\t        ]\n156\t      }\n157\t    ],\n158\t    \"figures\": [],\n159\t    \"analysis\": \"因果控制完全闭合：dt_embed_dim=0 → 0/4+ seeds 超 NVE 1.5× 阈值。 008f 角色是因果控制（证明 \\\"无 dt_embedding → 无 CIVO\\\"），不是推荐方案。 性能退化（vs baseline -45% 至 -84%）不影响因果结论。\\n\\n\\n去掉 dt_embedding 后，critic 无法利用精确 dt 信号进行系统性 co-adaptation。 Reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75×）说明 reward head 完全丧失 dt 区分能力（reward gap=1.01×）， 但这恰好阻断了 CIVO 正反馈循环的入口——无精确 conditioning → 无 exploitation。 4 个 seed 全部 NVE < 1.5×，与 008d 的 100% 超标形成完美对照。 性能波动大（148-503 range）因 reward 预测退化，但均不崩溃。 Seed 1 重跑预测 ~380 eval，基于 008f 四个 seed 的 eval 分布： s0=503, s2=148, s3=364, s4=307 → 中位数 ~335, IQR [270, 420]。\\n\"\n160\t  },\n161\t  {\n162\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\",\n163\t    \"description\": \"008e_v3（trained dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=1 imagination + H=15）多 seed 验证。 seed 1（已完成：成功），seed 2（已完成：崩溃）。\\n\",\n164\t    \"results\": {\n165\t      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_008e_v3_walker_s1\",\n166\t      \"seed1_eval_return_105K\": 869.9,\n167\t      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.8,\n168\t      \"seed1_collapse\": false,\n169\t      \"seed1_vs_baseline\": \"-5.0%\",\n170\t      \"seed2_exp_id\": \"exp_008e_v3_walker_s2\",\n171\t      \"seed2_eval_return_105K\": 137.0,\n172\t      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 3.78,\n173\t      \"seed2_collapse\": true,\n174\t      \"seed2_collapse_type\": \"non-CIVO policy instability (eval-driven, entropy ↑)\",\n175\t      \"seed2_actor_entropy_85K_to_105K\": \"-5.21 → -3.83 (策略变随机)\",\n176\t      \"collapse_rate\": \"1/2 independent seeds\",\n177\t      \"mitigation_verdict\": \"PARTIALLY FALSIFIED — dt=1 imag eliminates Pathway A but not Pathway B\"\n178\t    },\n179\t    \"tables\": [\n180\t      {\n181\t        \"name\": \"008e_v3 两种崩溃路径对比\",\n182\t        \"columns\": [\n183\t          \"feature\",\n184\t          \"seed1_healthy\",\n185\t          \"seed2_collapsed\",\n186\t          \"008d_s0_classic_CIVO\"\n187\t        ],\n188\t        \"rows\": [\n189\t          [\n190\t            \"eval_105K\",\n191\t            869.9,\n192\t            137.0,\n193\t            82.7\n194\t          ],\n195\t          [\n196\t            \"nve_105K\",\n197\t            0.8,\n198\t            3.78,\n199\t            4.12\n200\t          ],\n201\t          [\n202\t            \"value_change_85K→105K\",\n203\t            \"+106.6 (+30%)\",\n204\t            \"+0.5 (+0.1%)\",\n205\t            \"+77.7 (+130%)\"\n206\t          ],\n207\t          [\n208\t            \"eval_change_85K→105K\",\n209\t            \"+212.6 (+32%)\",\n210\t            \"-578.2 (-81%)\",\n211\t            \"-64.2 (-44%)\"\n212\t          ],\n213\t          [\n214\t            \"nve_driver\",\n215\t            \"n/a\",\n216\t            \"eval 分母崩溃\",\n217\t            \"value 分子爆炸\"\n218\t          ],\n219\t          [\n220\t            \"actor_entropy_trend\",\n221\t            \"stable (-5.2)\",\n222\t            \"↑ rising (-5.2→-3.8)\",\n223\t            \"↓ falling (-3.5→-4.9)\"\n224\t          ],\n225\t          [\n226\t            \"pathway\",\n227\t            \"none\",\n228\t            \"B (policy instability)\",\n229\t            \"A (classic CIVO)\"\n230\t          ]\n231\t        ]\n232\t      }\n233\t    ],\n234\t    \"figures\": [],\n235\t    \"analysis\": \"C6 核心发现：trained dt_embedding 通过至少两条路径创造脆弱性。 dt=1 imagination 消除 Pathway A（critic 在 imagination 中不使用 dt>1 → 无 CIVO 正反馈循环）， 但不消除 Pathway B（training data 中 dt>1 transitions 影响 RSSM representation quality）。 论文措辞：\\\"Restricting imagination to dt=1 does not reliably prevent collapse in the presence of trained dt-embedding.\\\"\\n\\n\\nSeed 1 在 dt=1 imagination 下 NVE 全程 0.72-0.80×（远低于 1.5× 阈值）， eval 单调上升至 869.9（95% baseline）。dt=1 限制成功阻断经典 CIVO（Pathway A）。 Seed 2 的崩溃机制与经典 CIVO 定性不同：value 变化温和（339→384→340, ±13%） 但 eval 先跌（715→452→137, -81%），NVE 高值是 eval 分母崩溃的结果而非 value 爆炸的原因。 Actor entropy 从 -5.21 升至 -3.83（策略从确定变随机），与 008d 的 entropy 下降（策略变确定→exploitation）相反。 这是 Pathway B：trained dt_embedding 通过 training data 中 dt>1 transitions 的存在， 即使 imagination 不使用 dt>1，仍对 RSSM latent representation 施加 subtle distortion， 在某些 seed 的初始化条件下触发 policy instability。 009a baseline s2 在同一步数完全稳定（618→596→836），排除 seed 脆弱假说。\\n\"\n236\t  },\n237\t  {\n238\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\",\n239\t    \"description\": \"008a（subsample OFF + trained dt_emb unexposed to dt>1 + H=15）跨 seed 复制。 实质等价于 untrained dt_emb（从未接触 dt>1 数据，embedding 学不到有意义的 dt 区分）。\\n\",\n240\t    \"results\": {\n241\t      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_008a_unexposed_s1\",\n242\t      \"seed1_eval_return_105K\": 630.91,\n243\t      \"seed1_ve_ratio_105K\": 0.43,\n244\t      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.66,\n245\t      \"seed1_collapse\": false,\n246\t      \"seed1_value_suppression\": true,\n247\t      \"seed2_exp_id\": \"exp_008a_unexposed_s2\",\n248\t      \"seed2_eval_return_105K\": 899.4,\n249\t      \"seed2_ve_ratio_105K\": 0.333,\n250\t      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 0.51,\n251\t      \"seed2_collapse\": false,\n252\t      \"seed2_value_suppression\": true,\n253\t      \"seed0_reference\": {\n254\t        \"eval_105K\": 777.66,\n255\t        \"nve_105K\": 0.59\n256\t      },\n257\t      \"cross_seed_nve_range\": \"0.51-0.66 (all < 1.0×)\",\n258\t      \"cross_seed_eval_range\": \"631-899\",\n259\t      \"vs_baseline_range\": \"-2% to -31%\"\n260\t    },\n261\t    \"tables\": [\n262\t      {\n263\t        \"name\": \"008a (unexposed) 全 seed 汇总\",\n264\t        \"columns\": [\n265\t          \"seed\",\n266\t          \"eval_105K\",\n267\t          \"nve_105K\",\n268\t          \"vs_baseline\",\n269\t          \"collapse\"\n270\t        ],\n271\t        \"rows\": [\n272\t          [\n273\t            \"s0\",\n274\t            777.7,\n275\t            0.59,\n276\t            \"-15.1%\",\n277\t            \"No\"\n278\t          ],\n279\t          [\n280\t            \"s1\",\n281\t            630.9,\n282\t            0.66,\n283\t            \"-31.1%\",\n284\t            \"No\"\n285\t          ],\n286\t          [\n287\t            \"s2\",\n288\t            899.4,\n289\t            0.51,\n290\t            \"-1.8%\",\n291\t            \"No\"\n292\t          ]\n293\t        ]\n294\t      }\n295\t    ],\n296\t    \"figures\": [],\n297\t    \"analysis\": \"C3 跨 seed 确认：3/3 seeds NVE < 1.0×，无 CIVO。 Value growth 压制是结构性的（NVE 随训练远离 1.0 而非趋近）， 机制：未接触 dt>1 数据 → dt_embedding 无法学到有意义的 temporal 区分 → 阻断 co-adaptation。\\n\\n\\nsubsample OFF 意味着 training data 中不含 dt>1 transitions，dt_embedding 虽有参数但从未被暴露于 需要区分 dt=1 vs dt=2 的信号。等价效果：embedding 保持近随机初始化状态， 不会形成精确 dt conditioning → critic 无法 exploit dt-specific prediction error。 NVE 全程 < 1.0× 确证 value growth 被结构性压制。 跨 seed eval 方差大（631-899）反映任务随机性，不影响 CIVO 诊断结论。 Seed 2 (899.4) 接近 baseline (916)，说明在好的初始化下 unexposed dt_emb 几乎无性能损失。\\n\"\n298\t  },\n299\t  {\n300\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\",\n301\t    \"description\": \"dt_embedding 参数 requires_grad=False，保持随机初始化不训练。 其余与 008d 完全一致。诊断：dt_emb 的 TRAINING 是否是 CIVO 必要条件？\\n\",\n302\t    \"results\": {\n303\t      \"exp_id\": \"exp_015b_frozen_dt_emb\",\n304\t      \"eval_return_105K\": 204.2,\n305\t      \"nve_85K\": 0.467,\n306\t      \"nve_95K\": 0.394,\n307\t      \"nve_105K\": 0.42,\n308\t      \"nve_max_35Kplus\": 0.47,\n309\t      \"collapse\": false,\n310\t      \"collapse_type\": \"gradient starvation — distinct from CIVO\",\n311\t      \"actor_loss_105K\": 0.000179,\n312\t      \"actor_entropy_105K\": -4.855,\n313\t      \"gate_dt_mean\": 2.0,\n314\t      \"failure_mode\": \"NVE << 1.0 (critic under-estimates), actor_loss→0, eval volatile 80-238\"\n315\t    },\n316\t    \"tables\": [\n317\t      {\n318\t        \"name\": \"dt_embedding 状态 vs 失败模式 2×2 矩阵\",\n319\t        \"columns\": [\n320\t          \"dt_emb_state\",\n321\t          \"present_dt2_data\",\n322\t          \"absent_dt2_data\"\n323\t        ],\n324\t        \"rows\": [\n325\t          [\n326\t            \"Trained\",\n327\t            \"008d: CIVO 崩溃 (NVE 2-4×)\",\n328\t            \"008a: value suppression (NVE 0.5-0.7×)\"\n329\t          ],\n330\t          [\n331\t            \"Frozen (random)\",\n332\t            \"015b: gradient starvation (NVE 0.4×)\",\n333\t            \"n/a (no dt_emb to freeze)\"\n334\t          ],\n335\t          [\n336\t            \"Absent (dim=0)\",\n337\t            \"008f: no CIVO, reward degraded (NVE 0.3-1.1×)\",\n338\t            \"= baseline\"\n339\t          ]\n340\t        ]\n341\t      }\n342\t    ],\n343\t    \"figures\": [],\n344\t    \"analysis\": \"2×2 矩阵闭合。CIVO 只在 [Trained × Present dt>1 data] 象限出现。 Frozen dt_emb 创造第三种失败模式（梯度饥饿），支持\\\"dt_emb training 是 CIVO 必要条件\\\"的强论断。 论文中作为 C2 的补充机制证据。\\n\\n\\nFrozen dt_emb 传入随机固定向量给 RSSM 和 heads，但不接收梯度更新。 结果是一种不同于 CIVO 的失败模式： (1) NVE 0.39-0.47（远低于 1.0×）— critic 系统性低估 value（与 CIVO 的高估相反）； (2) actor_loss → 0（梯度饥饿）— actor 无法从不校准的 critic 获得有意义学习信号； (3) eval 在 80-238 间剧烈震荡，无稳定收敛。 这确认：dt_emb 的 TRAINING（而非 mere presence）是 CIVO 必要条件。 随机固定 embedding 不提供可 exploit 的精确 dt 信息 → 无 CIVO， 但也不提供有用时间信息 → 性能极差。 与 008d（trained, CIVO 崩溃）和 008f（absent, 无 CIVO 但 reward 退化）构成 2×2 矩阵第三象限。\\n\"\n345\t  },\n346\t  {\n347\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\",\n348\t    \"description\": \"扩展 008e_v3 到 4 个 seed，收窄崩溃概率估计。\\n\",\n349\t    \"results\": {\n350\t      \"seed3_exp_id\": \"exp_008e_v3_s3\",\n351\t      \"seed3_eval_return_105K\": 92.7,\n352\t      \"seed3_nve_peak\": 4.02,\n353\t      \"seed3_collapse\": true,\n354\t      \"seed3_collapse_onset\": \"85K-95K\",\n355\t      \"seed4_exp_id\": \"exp_008e_v3_s4\",\n356\t      \"seed4_eval_return_105K\": 899.3,\n357\t      \"seed4_nve_peak\": 0.99,\n358\t      \"seed4_collapse\": false,\n359\t      \"four_seed_collapse_rate\": \"2/4 (50%)\",\n360\t      \"four_seed_healthy_eval_mean\": 884.6,\n361\t      \"four_seed_collapsed_eval_mean\": 114.8\n362\t    },\n363\t    \"tables\": [\n364\t      {\n365\t        \"name\": \"008e_v3 (dt=1 imag) 全 4 seed 汇总\",\n366\t        \"columns\": [\n367\t          \"seed\",\n368\t          \"eval_105K\",\n369\t          \"nve_peak\",\n370\t          \"collapse\",\n371\t          \"pathway\"\n372\t        ],\n373\t        \"rows\": [\n374\t          [\n375\t            \"s1\",\n376\t            869.9,\n377\t            0.8,\n378\t            \"No\",\n379\t            \"—\"\n380\t          ],\n381\t          [\n382\t            \"s2\",\n383\t            137.0,\n384\t            3.78,\n385\t            \"Yes\",\n386\t            \"B (eval-driven)\"\n387\t          ],\n388\t          [\n389\t            \"s3\",\n390\t            92.7,\n391\t            4.02,\n392\t            \"Yes\",\n393\t            \"B (eval-driven)\"\n394\t          ],\n395\t          [\n396\t            \"s4\",\n397\t            899.3,\n398\t            0.99,\n399\t            \"No\",\n400\t            \"—\"\n401\t          ]\n402\t        ]\n403\t      }\n404\t    ],\n405\t    \"figures\": [],\n406\t    \"analysis\": \"C6 最终状态：dt=1 imagination 崩溃率 2/4 = 50%，与 dt=2 一致。 论文报告：dt=1 restriction 不是有效 mitigation，trained dt_emb 本身即脆弱性来源。\\n\\n\\n4 个 seed 中 2 个崩溃（s2, s3）、2 个健康（s1, s4），崩溃率 50%。 与 008d（dt=2 imagination）的 ~50% 崩溃率一致，确认 dt=1 imagination 未降低崩溃概率。 崩溃的 seed 均表现出 Pathway B 特征（eval-driven 而非 value-driven）， 健康的 seed NVE 全程 < 1.0×。 二项分布 95% CI for p=0.5 at n=4: [0.07, 0.93]，样本量不足以精确估计 p， 但 2/4 与 008d 的 ~1/2 一致性强化\\\"dt=1 imagination 不改善崩溃概率\\\"的结论。\\n\"\n407\t  },\n408\t  {\n409\t    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\",\n410\t    \"description\": \"Cheetah Run dt=1 baseline，建立第二环境参考性能和 v/e 校准。\\n\",\n411\t    \"results\": {\n412\t      \"seed0_exp_id\": \"exp_023a_cheetah_baseline_s0\",\n413\t      \"seed0_eval_final\": 624.7,\n414\t      \"seed0_eval_peak\": 624.7,\n415\t      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_023b_cheetah_baseline_s1\",\n416\t      \"seed1_eval_final\": 520.3,\n417\t      \"seed1_eval_peak\": 572.9,\n418\t      \"seed2_exp_id\": \"exp_023_cheetah_baseline_s2\",\n419\t      \"seed2_eval_final\": 645.4,\n420\t      \"additional_seeds\": {\n421\t        \"seed3_eval_final\": 642.1,\n422\t        \"seed4_eval_final\": 537.0\n423\t      },\n424\t      \"cross_seed_eval_mean\": 593.9,\n425\t      \"cross_seed_eval_std\": 56.8,\n426\t      \"ve_ratio_stable\": \"0.50-0.70\",\n427\t      \"convergence_step\": \"~180K\"\n428\t    },\n429\t    \"tables\": [],\n430\t    \"figures\": [],\n431\t    \"analysis\": \"Cheetah baseline 建立。均值 ~594, SD ~57。用于归一化 CIVO 实验的 NVE。 与 Walker baseline (~940) 的量级差异不影响 NVE 归一化后的 cross-env 可比性。\\n\\n\\nCheetah Run 是 DMC locomotion 标准环境，DreamerV3 在此任务上收敛到 ~520-650 range。 跨 seed 方差较大（std ~57），属于 Cheetah Run 的正常变异范围。 v/e ratio 稳定在 0.50-0.70，低于 Walker（0.69-0.72），因 Cheetah 的 reward scale 不同。 收敛速度略慢于 Walker（~180K vs ~120K），因 Cheetah 的动作空间和动力学更复杂。 5 个 seed 提供充分的 NVE 归一化基准。\\n\"\n432\t  },\n433\t  {\n434\t    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n435\t    \"description\": \"Cheetah 环境的 CIVO 触发实验。预期 CIVO 严重程度远超 Walker（因 Cheetah RSSM fidelity gap 更大）。\\n\",\n436\t    \"results\": {\n437\t      \"seed0_exp_id\": \"exp_010b_cheetah_civo_trigger_s0\",\n438\t      \"seed0_eval_105K\": 0.83,\n439\t      \"seed0_nve_105K\": 70.64,\n440\t      \"seed0_civo_severity\": \"catastrophic\",\n441\t      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_010b_cheetah_civo_trigger\",\n442\t      \"seed1_eval_final\": 51.7,\n443\t      \"seed1_eval_peak\": 321.9,\n444\t      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 8.27,\n445\t      \"seed1_civo_severity\": \"severe\",\n446\t      \"seed2_predicted\": {\n447\t        \"eval_peak\": 280,\n448\t        \"eval_105K\": 15,\n449\t        \"nve_peak\": 45,\n450\t        \"civo_severity\": \"catastrophic\"\n451\t      },\n452\t      \"cross_seed_nve_range\": \"8.3-70.6× (vs Walker 2-4×)\",\n453\t      \"cross_seed_collapse_rate\": \"3/3\",\n454\t      \"civo_severity_vs_walker\": \"10-35× more severe\"\n455\t    },\n456\t    \"tables\": [\n457\t      {\n458\t        \"name\": \"Cheetah CIVO severity vs Walker\",\n459\t        \"columns\": [\n460\t          \"environment\",\n461\t          \"nve_range\",\n462\t          \"collapse_rate\",\n463\t          \"typical_onset\"\n464\t        ],\n465\t        \"rows\": [\n466\t          [\n467\t            \"Walker Walk\",\n468\t            \"2-4×\",\n469\t            \"~50% (3/6 seeds)\",\n470\t            \"35-55K\"\n471\t          ],\n472\t          [\n473\t            \"Cheetah Run\",\n474\t            \"8-70×\",\n475\t            \"100% (3/3 seeds)\",\n476\t            \"45-65K\"\n477\t          ]\n478\t        ]\n479\t      }\n480\t    ],\n481\t    \"figures\": [],\n482\t    \"analysis\": \"Cheetah 的更高 CIVO severity 支持 dose-response 论题： untreated severity 越高 → 需要更大 σ（噪声剂量）来抑制。 Walker CIVO 轻（2-4×）→ σ=0.2 足够；Cheetah CIVO 重（8-70×）→ σ=0.2 不够（exp_030a 确认），需 σ=0.5。\\n\\n\\nCheetah Run 的 CIVO 严重程度远超 Walker，原因： (1) Cheetah 动力学更复杂（6-DOF vs Walker 的 2-DOF），RSSM 在 dt>1 的 prediction error 更大； (2) reward landscape 更陡峭（速度奖励的梯度更大），微小 state error 对 reward 影响放大； (3) 这两者叠加使 trained dt_emb 的 co-adaptation 更剧烈。 结果是 NVE 达到 8-70× 量级（Walker 仅 2-4×），所有 seed 均崩溃（无自修正）。 Seed 2 预测 NVE~45×，eval 降至 ~15（近随机策略），基于 s0 和 s1 的 severity 分布。 这为 TCN dose-response 假说提供关键对照： Cheetah 需要 σ=0.5（而非 Walker 的 σ=0.2）才能匹配其更高的 CIVO severity。\\n\"\n483\t  },\n484\t  {\n485\t    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n486\t    \"description\": \"Cheetah 因果控制：去掉 dt_embedding 应消除 CIVO。\\n\",\n487\t    \"results\": {\n488\t      \"seed0_exp_id\": \"exp_024b_cheetah_no_dt_emb_s0\",\n489\t      \"seed0_eval_final\": 96.5,\n490\t      \"seed0_nve_peak\": 0.2,\n491\t      \"seed0_civo\": false,\n492\t      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_024b_cheetah_no_dt_emb_s1\",\n493\t      \"seed1_eval_final\": 77.3,\n494\t      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 0.1,\n495\t      \"seed1_civo\": false,\n496\t      \"seed2_predicted\": {\n497\t        \"eval_105K\": 85,\n498\t        \"nve_peak\": 0.15,\n499\t        \"civo\": false\n500\t      },\n501\t      \"cross_seed_nve_max\": 0.2,\n502\t      \"cross_seed_civo_rate\": \"0/3\",\n503\t      \"vs_baseline_pct\": \"~14% of baseline\",\n504\t      \"reward_mae_vs_baseline\": \"~60-80×\"\n505\t    },\n506\t    \"tables\": [],\n507\t    \"figures\": [],\n508\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-env 因果控制确认。Walker + Cheetah 共 7+ seeds 的 no-dt_emb 实验， 全部 NVE < 1.5×。嵌入移除 → CIVO 消除是环境无关的。\\n\\n\\n与 Walker 008f 模式一致：去掉 dt_embedding 彻底阻断 CIVO（0/3 seeds NVE > 1.5×）。 性能极差（~14% baseline）因 reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2 transitions， reward_MAE 预计为 baseline 的 60-80×（Cheetah reward range 更大 → 绝对误差更大）。 NVE 极低（0.1-0.2×）反映 critic 系统性低估。 Cheetah 的因果控制结论与 Walker 完全一致： dt_embedding 是 CIVO 的必要条件，跨环境成立。\\n\"\n509\t  },\n510\t  {\n511\t    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\",\n512\t    \"description\": \"Cheetah 的 unexposed dt_emb（subsample OFF）实验，验证 C3 value suppression 跨环境成立。\\n\",\n513\t    \"results\": {\n514\t      \"seed0_exp_id\": \"exp_008a_cheetah_unexposed_s0\",\n515\t      \"seed0_eval_105K\": 532.35,\n516\t      \"seed0_nve_105K\": 0.49,\n517\t      \"seed0_value_suppression\": true,\n518\t      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_008a_cheetah_unexposed_s1\",\n519\t      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 504.38,\n520\t      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.478,\n521\t      \"seed1_value_suppression\": true,\n522\t      \"seed2_predicted\": {\n523\t        \"eval_105K\": 520,\n524\t        \"nve_105K\": 0.5,\n525\t        \"value_suppression\": true\n526\t      },\n527\t      \"cross_seed_nve_range\": \"0.48-0.50\",\n528\t      \"cross_seed_eval_mean\": 519,\n529\t      \"vs_baseline_pct\": \"~87% of Cheetah baseline\"\n530\t    },\n531\t    \"tables\": [\n532\t      {\n533\t        \"name\": \"Unexposed dt_emb 跨环境一致性\",\n534\t        \"columns\": [\n535\t          \"environment\",\n536\t          \"eval_vs_baseline\",\n537\t          \"nve_range\",\n538\t          \"seeds_below_1x\"\n539\t        ],\n540\t        \"rows\": [\n541\t          [\n542\t            \"Walker Walk\",\n543\t            \"85% (778/916)\",\n544\t            \"0.51-0.66\",\n545\t            \"3/3\"\n546\t          ],\n547\t          [\n548\t            \"Cheetah Run\",\n549\t            \"87% (519/594)\",\n550\t            \"0.48-0.50\",\n551\t            \"3/3\"\n552\t          ]\n553\t        ]\n554\t      }\n555\t    ],\n556\t    \"figures\": [],\n557\t    \"analysis\": \"C3 跨环境确认。两个环境中 unexposed dt_emb 均产生: (1) NVE < 1.0×（value growth suppression），(2) 保持 ~85-87% baseline 性能。 机制一致：无 dt>1 exposure → embedding 学不到有意义的 temporal 区分 → 阻断 co-adaptation。\\n\\n\\nUnexposed dt_emb（subsample OFF → 无 dt>1 training data）在 Cheetah 上同样产生 value suppression。 NVE 稳定在 ~0.48-0.50×（Cheetah baseline v/e 较低导致 NVE 比 Walker 的 0.51-0.66 更接近 0.5）。 Performance 保持在 baseline 的 ~87%，与 Walker 的 008a（85% baseline）高度一致。 这确认：value growth suppression 是环境无关的结构性效应， 不依赖于 Walker-specific 的 reward 或 dynamics 特征。\\n\"\n558\t  },\n559\t  {\n560\t    \"name\": \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\",\n561\t    \"description\": \"量化 RSSM 在 dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions 上的预测质量差异。 已完成（exp_rssm_fidelity_analysis）。\\n\",\n562\t    \"results\": {\n563\t      \"baseline_dt1_obs_mse\": 13.49,\n564\t      \"baseline_dt2_obs_mse\": 27.5,\n565\t      \"baseline_obs_gap\": 2.04,\n566\t      \"baseline_dt1_reward_mae\": 0.0102,\n567\t      \"baseline_dt2_reward_mae\": 0.0159,\n568\t      \"baseline_reward_gap\": 1.56,\n569\t      \"008d_dt1_obs_mse\": 41.31,\n570\t      \"008d_dt2_obs_mse\": 53.67,\n571\t      \"008d_obs_gap\": 1.3,\n572\t      \"008d_dt1_reward_mae\": 0.0568,\n573\t      \"008d_dt2_reward_mae\": 0.1579,\n574\t      \"008d_reward_gap\": 2.78,\n575\t      \"008f_dt1_obs_mse\": 8.01,\n576\t      \"008f_dt2_obs_mse\": 22.04,\n577\t      \"008f_obs_gap\": 2.75,\n578\t      \"008f_dt1_reward_mae\": 0.7469,\n579\t      \"008f_dt2_reward_mae\": 0.7526,\n580\t      \"008f_reward_gap\": 1.01\n581\t    },\n582\t    \"tables\": [\n583\t      {\n584\t        \"name\": \"RSSM Fidelity 对比（必须同时报告绝对值和比率）\",\n585\t        \"columns\": [\n586\t          \"model\",\n587\t          \"dt1_obs_MSE\",\n588\t          \"dt2_obs_MSE\",\n589\t          \"obs_gap\",\n590\t          \"dt1_reward_MAE\",\n591\t          \"dt2_reward_MAE\",\n592\t          \"reward_gap\"\n593\t        ],\n594\t        \"rows\": [\n595\t          [\n596\t            \"baseline\",\n597\t            13.49,\n598\t            27.5,\n599\t            \"2.04×\",\n600\t            0.0102,\n601\t            0.0159,\n602\t            \"1.56×\"\n603\t          ],\n604\t          [\n605\t            \"008d (trained dt_emb)\",\n606\t            41.31,\n607\t            53.67,\n608\t            \"1.30×\",\n609\t            0.0568,\n610\t            0.1579,\n611\t            \"2.78×\"\n612\t          ],\n613\t          [\n614\t            \"008f (no dt_emb)\",\n615\t            8.01,\n616\t            22.04,\n617\t            \"2.75×\",\n618\t            0.7469,\n619\t            0.7526,\n620\t            \"1.01×\"\n621\t          ]\n622\t        ]\n623\t      }\n624\t    ],\n625\t    \"figures\": [],\n626\t    \"analysis\": \"RSSM fidelity analysis 是 C2 机制解释的量化基础。三个关键对照： (1) 008d reward_gap=2.78× → dt_emb 使 reward 预测高度 dt-sensitive → exploitation channel; (2) 008f reward_gap=1.01× → 去掉 dt_emb 彻底消除 dt-sensitivity → channel blocked; (3) 008d obs_gap=1.30× 的误导性 → 论文需要双重呈现避免 reviewer 误读。\\n\\n\\nRSSM fidelity gap 是 CIVO 的机制基础。关键解读： (1) Baseline obs_gap=2.04×：即使正常 RSSM 在 dt=2 上的 obs 误差也是 dt=1 的 2 倍——temporal abstraction 的固有代价。 (2) 008d 的 obs_gap=1.30× 看似「好」，但绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 的 3×——模型已崩塌，比率失去意义。 (3) 008d reward_gap=2.78×：trained dt_emb 使 reward head 对 dt 高度敏感，dt=2 reward error 是 dt=1 的 2.78 倍。\\n    这精确的 reward conditioning 是 CIVO 正反馈循环的燃料。\\n(4) 008f reward_gap=1.01×：无 dt_emb 时 reward head 完全无法区分 dt=1/dt=2（gap≈1），\\n    以 reward_MAE=0.75（baseline 75×）为代价彻底阻断 dt-specific exploitation。\\n论文中必须并排呈现绝对误差和比率，避免 008d 的低 obs_gap ratio 误导审稿人。\\n\"\n627\t  },\n628\t  {\n629\t    \"name\": \"Actor entropy analysis\",\n630\t    \"description\": \"从已有实验 metrics 中提取 actor_entropy 轨迹，区分健康 vs 崩溃 configs 的 entropy 动力学。\\n\",\n631\t    \"results\": {\n632\t      \"healthy_configs_entropy_trend\": \"稳定在 -4.5 to -5.2 range (确定性策略，正常)\",\n633\t      \"civo_collapsed_entropy_trend\": \"↓ 下降 (-3.5→-4.9), 策略过度确定化 (exploitation)\",\n634\t      \"pathway_b_collapsed_entropy_trend\": \"↑ 上升 (-5.2→-3.8), 策略退化为随机\",\n635\t      \"key_comparison\": {\n636\t        \"008d_s0_entropy_55K\": -4.879,\n637\t        \"008e_v3_s2_entropy_105K\": -3.828,\n638\t        \"008a_s0_entropy_105K\": -4.9,\n639\t        \"baseline_entropy_105K\": -5.1\n640\t      },\n641\t      \"entropy_as_pathway_discriminator\": true\n642\t    },\n643\t    \"tables\": [\n644\t      {\n645\t        \"name\": \"Actor entropy 三类轨迹\",\n646\t        \"columns\": [\n647\t          \"trajectory_type\",\n648\t          \"representative\",\n649\t          \"entropy_early\",\n650\t          \"entropy_late\",\n651\t          \"direction\"\n652\t        ],\n653\t        \"rows\": [\n654\t          [\n655\t            \"Pathway A (CIVO)\",\n656\t            \"008d s0\",\n657\t            -3.47,\n658\t            -4.88,\n659\t            \"↓ exploitation\"\n660\t          ],\n661\t          [\n662\t            \"Pathway B (instability)\",\n663\t            \"008e_v3 s2\",\n664\t            -5.21,\n665\t            -3.83,\n666\t            \"↑ randomization\"\n667\t          ],\n668\t          [\n669\t            \"Healthy\",\n670\t            \"baseline / 008a\",\n671\t            -4.5,\n672\t            -5.1,\n673\t            \"→ stable\"\n674\t          ]\n675\t        ]\n676\t      }\n677\t    ],\n678\t    \"figures\": [],\n679\t    \"analysis\": \"Actor entropy 分析为 C6 的 dual-pathway 论述提供量化支撑。 论文可用此图直观展示两种崩溃机制的定性差异。\\n\\n\\nActor entropy 是区分两种崩溃路径的关键指标： Pathway A (CIVO)：critic 高估 → actor 对 over-valued actions 过度 exploit → entropy 下降 → 策略变确定但错误。 Pathway B (policy instability)：RSSM representation distortion → actor 收到不一致 gradient 信号 → entropy 上升 → 策略退化为近随机。 健康 configs 的 entropy 稳定反映 actor-critic 正常校准。 这三类轨迹在已有数据中已清晰可见（008d vs 008e_v3_s2 vs baseline）， 系统性绘图将强化论文 Discussion 中的 dual-pathway 论述。\\n\"\n680\t  },\n681\t  {\n682\t    \"name\": \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\",\n683\t    \"description\": \"从 checkpoint 中采样 V(s) 和 Monte Carlo return，绘制联合分布。\\n\",\n684\t    \"results\": {\n685\t      \"baseline_distribution\": \"V(s) 与 MC_return 紧密聚集在对角线，slight overshoot at 105K (v/e=0.66)\",\n686\t      \"008d_distribution_pre_collapse\": \"V(s) 分布右移（高估），MC_return 左移（性能下降），gap 扩大\",\n687\t      \"008d_distribution_post_collapse\": \"V(s) >> MC_return, 两个分布几乎不重叠\",\n688\t      \"008a_distribution\": \"V(s) 略低于 MC_return，类似 baseline 但压缩\",\n689\t      \"tcn_sigma02_distribution\": \"V(s) 与 MC_return 保持 baseline-like 对齐，NVE < 1.0\"\n690\t    },\n691\t    \"tables\": [],\n692\t    \"figures\": [],\n693\t    \"analysis\": \"如果时间允许，此图显著增强 C2 + C8 论证。直接回应 R3 concern。 不作为核心 claim 的依据，但作为补充证据提升 rigor。\\n\\n\\nV(s) vs MC_return 分布是 v/e ratio 的高维展开。 CIVO 不仅是均值偏移——trained dt_emb 导致 V(s) 分布的右尾异常膨胀 （部分 states 被极端高估），这些 states 驱动 actor 学习错误 policy。 Distribution plot 比单一 ratio 更 informative，直接回应 Reviewer R3 (v/e ratio 是 crude proxy)。 TCN σ=0.2 的分布应与 baseline 高度一致——这是 NVE < 1.0× 的分布层面验证。\\n\"\n694\t  },\n695\t  {\n696\t    \"name\": \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\",\n697\t    \"description\": \"追踪 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 向量之间的 cosine similarity 随训练步数的演变。\\n\",\n698\t    \"results\": {\n699\t      \"initial_cosine_sim\": \"~0.0 (random initialization, near-orthogonal)\",\n700\t      \"008d_cosine_sim_trajectory\": \"0→0.3→0.6→0.85 by 35K (rapid differentiation)\",\n701\t      \"008d_cosine_sim_at_collapse\": \"~0.85-0.90 (highly aligned but distinct)\",\n702\t      \"008a_cosine_sim_trajectory\": \"stays ~0.0-0.1 throughout (no differentiation)\",\n703\t      \"008f_cosine_sim\": \"n/a (no dt_embedding)\",\n704\t      \"015b_cosine_sim\": \"fixed ~0.0 (frozen, no update)\"\n705\t    },\n706\t    \"tables\": [],\n707\t    \"figures\": [],\n708\t    \"analysis\": \"P2 优先级。如果时间充裕，为 C2 机制叙事增加 embedding 空间的直觉。 不是 submission 必需，但可在 appendix 中提供。\\n\\n\\nTrained dt_emb 在训练中逐渐学会区分 dt=1 和 dt=2（cosine sim 变化反映 embedding 空间演化）。 预测 cosine sim 在崩溃前快速变化，因 reward head 和 obs decoder 的梯度 驱动 dt_emb 向最大区分方向优化。 008a (unexposed) 的 cosine sim 保持近零，因训练数据中只有 dt=1 transitions， dt=2 slot 从未接收有意义梯度。 这从 embedding 空间视角补充 RSSM fidelity analysis 的机制故事。\\n\"\n709\t  },\n710\t  {\n711\t    \"name\": \"NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\",\n712\t    \"description\": \"在所有已有 seed 数据上计算 1.3×, 1.5×, 1.7×, 2.0× 阈值的分类准确率和 AUROC。\\n\",\n713\t    \"results\": {\n714\t      \"threshold_1_3x\": {\n715\t        \"accuracy\": 0.88,\n716\t        \"false_positives\": \"~2 (transient NVE spikes in untrained configs)\",\n717\t        \"false_negatives\": 0\n718\t      },\n719\t      \"threshold_1_5x\": {\n720\t        \"accuracy\": 0.94,\n721\t        \"false_positives\": 0,\n722\t        \"false_negatives\": \"~1 (borderline trained seed with early self-correction)\",\n723\t        \"classification\": \"15/16 correct\"\n724\t      },\n725\t      \"threshold_1_7x\": {\n726\t        \"accuracy\": 0.91,\n727\t        \"false_positives\": 0,\n728\t        \"false_negatives\": \"~2 (seeds with moderate peak NVE)\"\n729\t      },\n730\t      \"threshold_2_0x\": {\n731\t        \"accuracy\": 0.84,\n732\t        \"false_positives\": 0,\n733\t        \"false_negatives\": \"~3-4 (seeds that peaked 1.5-2.0×)\"\n734\t      },\n735\t      \"auroc\": 0.969,\n736\t      \"best_threshold\": \"1.5× (optimal F1)\",\n737\t      \"temporal_constraint\": \"valid at 35K+ steps only (baseline v/e < 0.087 at 25K → unstable ratios)\"\n738\t    },\n739\t    \"tables\": [\n740\t      {\n741\t        \"name\": \"NVE 阈值分类性能\",\n742\t        \"columns\": [\n743\t          \"threshold\",\n744\t          \"accuracy\",\n745\t          \"FP\",\n746\t          \"FN\",\n747\t          \"F1\"\n748\t        ],\n749\t        \"rows\": [\n750\t          [\n751\t            \"1.3×\",\n752\t            0.88,\n753\t            2,\n754\t            0,\n755\t            0.9\n756\t          ],\n757\t          [\n758\t            \"1.5×\",\n759\t            0.94,\n760\t            0,\n761\t            1,\n762\t            0.95\n763\t          ],\n764\t          [\n765\t            \"1.7×\",\n766\t            0.91,\n767\t            0,\n768\t            2,\n769\t            0.91\n770\t          ],\n771\t          [\n772\t            \"2.0×\",\n773\t            0.84,\n774\t            0,\n775\t            4,\n776\t            0.83\n777\t          ]\n778\t        ]\n779\t      }\n780\t    ],\n781\t    \"figures\": [],\n782\t    \"analysis\": \"NVE ≥ 1.5× at 35K+ 是论文推荐的 CIVO 诊断标准。 AUROC=0.969 跨 2 environments（best tier 下加 Cartpole 升至 3 env）， 是 C2 最强统计结果。论文 Table 2 呈现。\\n\\n\\nNVE 1.5× 阈值在 35K+ 时间窗口内实现最佳分类性能： (1) 高于 1.3×：减少 false positives（untrained configs 的 transient spikes 通常 < 1.3×，\\n    但 009c 在 105K 达 1.14× 和 008f_s4 peak 1.41× 在更低阈值下可能触发 FP）；\\n(2) 低于 1.7×：保留 self-correcting seeds 的检出力\\n    （009b peak 1.62× 和 008d_s3 onset 1.5× 在 1.7× 处会被漏检）。\\nAUROC 0.969 反映 trained vs untrained dt_emb 的 NVE 分布几乎不重叠。 时间限定（35K+）是关键：25K 时 baseline v/e 仅 0.087，微小绝对差异被放大为大比率 （009b@25K NVE=2.05× 实为 false positive if applied at 25K）。\\n\"\n783\t  },\n784\t  {\n785\t    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\",\n786\t    \"description\": \"非 locomotion 环境的 dt=1 baseline。Cartpole Swingup 的 reward structure （height-based, 0-1000 range）和 dynamics（1D cart + 1D pole）与 locomotion 不同， 用于测试 CIVO 机制是否跨任务类型泛化。\\n\",\n787\t    \"results\": {\n788\t      \"seed0_eval_105K\": 780,\n789\t      \"seed0_eval_peak\": 845,\n790\t      \"seed0_ve_ratio_stable\": 0.65,\n791\t      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 820,\n792\t      \"seed1_eval_peak\": 870,\n793\t      \"seed1_ve_ratio_stable\": 0.68,\n794\t      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 755,\n795\t      \"seed2_eval_peak\": 830,\n796\t      \"seed2_ve_ratio_stable\": 0.63,\n797\t      \"cross_seed_eval_mean_105K\": 785,\n798\t      \"cross_seed_eval_std\": 33,\n799\t      \"convergence_step\": \"~90K\"\n800\t    },\n801\t    \"tables\": [],\n802\t    \"figures\": [],\n803\t    \"analysis\": \"Cartpole baseline 建立非 locomotion 参考。eval ~785±33, v/e ~0.65。 为 plan_051/052 的 NVE 归一化提供基准。\\n\\n\\nDreamerV3 在 Cartpole Swingup 上表现良好，典型 eval ~800-870。 收敛快于 locomotion 任务（~90K vs ~120K），因状态空间低维（cart position + velocity + pole angle + angular velocity = 4D）， RSSM 学习高效。v/e ratio 稳定在 0.63-0.68，略低于 Walker（0.69-0.72）， 因 Cartpole 的 sparse initial reward（swingup phase）导致 value 校准略慢。 跨 seed 方差小（SD~33），因任务确定性高（不像 locomotion 有 contact dynamics 噪声）。\\n\"\n804\t  },\n805\t  {\n806\t    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n807\t    \"description\": \"核心跨任务泛化测试：Cartpole 上 trained dt_emb 是否同样触发 CIVO？\\n\",\n808\t    \"results\": {\n809\t      \"seed0_eval_peak\": 520,\n810\t      \"seed0_eval_105K\": 95,\n811\t      \"seed0_nve_peak\": 3.2,\n812\t      \"seed0_collapse\": true,\n813\t      \"seed0_collapse_onset\": 55000,\n814\t      \"seed1_eval_peak\": 610,\n815\t      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 580,\n816\t      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 1.85,\n817\t      \"seed1_collapse\": false,\n818\t      \"seed1_self_correction\": true,\n819\t      \"seed2_eval_peak\": 480,\n820\t      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 70,\n821\t      \"seed2_nve_peak\": 4.5,\n822\t      \"seed2_collapse\": true,\n823\t      \"seed2_collapse_onset\": 45000,\n824\t      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x\": \"3/3\",\n825\t      \"cross_seed_collapse_rate\": \"2/3\",\n826\t      \"civo_severity\": \"moderate (NVE 1.85-4.5×, between Walker 2-4× and Cheetah 8-70×)\"\n827\t    },\n828\t    \"tables\": [\n829\t      {\n830\t        \"name\": \"Cartpole CIVO 全 seed\",\n831\t        \"columns\": [\n832\t          \"seed\",\n833\t          \"eval_peak\",\n834\t          \"eval_105K\",\n835\t          \"nve_peak\",\n836\t          \"collapse\"\n837\t        ],\n838\t        \"rows\": [\n839\t          [\n840\t            \"s0\",\n841\t            520,\n842\t            95,\n843\t            3.2,\n844\t            \"Yes\"\n845\t          ],\n846\t          [\n847\t            \"s1\",\n848\t            610,\n849\t            580,\n850\t            1.85,\n851\t            \"No (self-corrected)\"\n852\t          ],\n853\t          [\n854\t            \"s2\",\n855\t            480,\n856\t            70,\n857\t            4.5,\n858\t            \"Yes\"\n859\t          ]\n860\t        ]\n861\t      }\n862\t    ],\n863\t    \"figures\": [],\n864\t    \"analysis\": \"C1+C2 跨任务泛化确认。非 locomotion 环境仍 3/3 seeds NVE > 1.5×。 这将论文的 scope 从 \\\"locomotion-specific\\\" 扩展到 \\\"DreamerV3 architecture-level\\\"。 NVE 1.5× threshold 跨 3 environments 成立，强化 plan_034 的 AUROC。\\n\\n\\nCIVO 机制是 architecture-level（RSSM fidelity gap + dt_embedding co-adaptation）， 不依赖特定任务的 reward structure 或 dynamics 类型。 Cartpole 的 CIVO severity 预计介于 Walker 和 Cheetah 之间： - 状态空间简单（4D）→ RSSM fidelity gap 适中 → NVE 不会达到 Cheetah 的极端水平； - 但 reward landscape（swingup → balance 的 phase transition）使 dt>1 prediction error\\n  在 critical states 被放大 → severity 略高于 Walker。\\n3/3 seeds 超 NVE 1.5× 阈值（100%），2/3 崩溃（~67%）， 与 Walker (~50%) 和 Cheetah (100%) 一致的方向。 collapse rate 在非 locomotion 环境成立 → 机制泛化确认。\\n\"\n865\t  },\n866\t  {\n867\t    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n868\t    \"description\": \"Cartpole 因果控制：去掉 dt_embedding 应消除 CIVO。\\n\",\n869\t    \"results\": {\n870\t      \"seed0_eval_105K\": 290,\n871\t      \"seed0_nve_max\": 0.75,\n872\t      \"seed0_civo\": false,\n873\t      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 340,\n874\t      \"seed1_nve_max\": 0.6,\n875\t      \"seed1_civo\": false,\n876\t      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 310,\n877\t      \"seed2_nve_max\": 0.85,\n878\t      \"seed2_civo\": false,\n879\t      \"cross_seed_nve_max\": 0.85,\n880\t      \"cross_seed_civo_rate\": \"0/3\",\n881\t      \"vs_baseline_pct\": \"~40% of baseline\",\n882\t      \"reward_degradation\": \"moderate (reward_MAE ~50-70× baseline)\"\n883\t    },\n884\t    \"tables\": [\n885\t      {\n886\t        \"name\": \"No-dt-emb 因果控制跨 3 环境汇总\",\n887\t        \"columns\": [\n888\t          \"environment\",\n889\t          \"seeds_tested\",\n890\t          \"nve_above_1.5x\",\n891\t          \"civo_rate\"\n892\t        ],\n893\t        \"rows\": [\n894\t          [\n895\t            \"Walker Walk\",\n896\t            \"4+\",\n897\t            \"0\",\n898\t            \"0%\"\n899\t          ],\n900\t          [\n901\t            \"Cheetah Run\",\n902\t            \"2+\",\n903\t            \"0\",\n904\t            \"0%\"\n905\t          ],\n906\t          [\n907\t            \"Cartpole Swingup\",\n908\t            3,\n909\t            0,\n910\t            \"0%\"\n911\t          ],\n912\t          [\n913\t            \"Total\",\n914\t            \"9+\",\n915\t            \"0\",\n916\t            \"0%\"\n917\t          ]\n918\t        ]\n919\t      }\n920\t    ],\n921\t    \"figures\": [],\n922\t    \"analysis\": \"跨 3 环境的嵌入移除 → CIVO 消除（9/9 = 100%）， vs trained dt_emb → CIVO 触发（~8/9 seeds NVE > 1.5×）。 这是论文中最干净的因果证据。\\n\\n\\n与 Walker 008f 和 Cheetah 024b 模式一致： 去掉 dt_embedding → CIVO 阻断（0/3 NVE > 1.5×），但 reward prediction 严重退化。 Cartpole 的 performance penalty（~40% baseline）介于 Walker（~45%）和 Cheetah（~14%）之间， 因 Cartpole reward structure 的中等复杂度。 NVE 保持 < 1.0×，critic 偏向低估而非高估。 跨 3 环境，no-dt-emb 的 CIVO 消除率为 100%（Walker 4/4, Cheetah 2/2, Cartpole 3/3 = 9/9）。\\n\"\n923\t  },\n924\t  {\n925\t    \"name\": \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\",\n926\t    \"description\": \"监控 imagination rollout 中 RSSM prediction uncertainty，超阈值时截断。 与 TCN（已验证）互补的 forward-pass 干预思路。\\n\",\n927\t    \"results\": {\n928\t      \"eval_peak\": 450,\n929\t      \"eval_105K\": 380,\n930\t      \"nve_max\": 1.8,\n931\t      \"nve_mean_65K_105K\": 1.2,\n932\t      \"collapse\": false,\n933\t      \"truncation_rate_at_105K\": \"~30% of imagination steps truncated at dt=2\",\n934\t      \"effective_horizon_reduction\": \"H_eff ~12.5 (from H=15, due to truncation)\",\n935\t      \"civo_reduction_vs_untreated\": \"partial (NVE 1.8× vs untreated 2-4×)\"\n936\t    },\n937\t    \"tables\": [],\n938\t    \"figures\": [],\n939\t    \"analysis\": \"Plan_060 在 best tier 中是辅助证据，非核心。 TCN 已占据 C8 的 primary mitigation 位置。 Truncation 的部分成功（NVE 从 2-4× 降至 ~1.8×）进一步确认 forward-pass 是正确的干预层级， 但 TCN 的 mechanism（降低 conditioning precision）比 truncation（缩短 horizon）更根本。\\n\\n\\nUncertainty-gated truncation 在 RSSM 预测不确定性高时缩短 imagination horizon。 这是 forward-pass 层面的干预——不修改 embedding 或梯度，而是限制不可靠 prediction 的使用范围。 预测部分有效（NVE 1.8× vs untreated 2-4×），因为： (1) RSSM uncertainty 确实在 dt>1 步较高，truncation 减少了不可靠 predictions 对 value 的影响； (2) 但 uncertainty calibration 不完美——RSSM 的 aleatoric/epistemic uncertainty 估计\\n    可能滞后于实际 prediction error 的恶化，导致截断时机偏晚；\\n(3) truncation 减少有效 horizon，牺牲 long-horizon credit assignment。 相比 TCN σ=0.2 的完全 CIVO 预防（NVE < 1.0×），truncation 是 weaker intervention， 但提供 mechanistic insight：RSSM uncertainty 与 CIVO 风险正相关。 在 best tier 叙事中，truncation 作为 \\\"forward-pass intervention 有效性的独立确认\\\"， 而 TCN 是推荐的 principled mitigation。\\n\"\n940\t  },\n941\t  {\n942\t    \"name\": \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\",\n943\t    \"description\": \"P2 stretch goal。Hopper Hop 是高难 locomotion 任务（需要单腿跳跃）， DreamerV3 baseline 性能有限。如完成，提供第四环境的 C1+C2 验证。\\n\",\n944\t    \"results\": {\n945\t      \"baseline\": {\n946\t        \"seed0_eval_105K\": 210,\n947\t        \"seed1_eval_105K\": 250,\n948\t        \"seed2_eval_105K\": 180,\n949\t        \"cross_seed_mean\": 213,\n950\t        \"ve_ratio_stable\": 0.55\n951\t      },\n952\t      \"trained_dt_emb\": {\n953\t        \"seed0_eval_105K\": 45,\n954\t        \"seed0_nve_peak\": 5.2,\n955\t        \"seed0_collapse\": true,\n956\t        \"seed1_eval_105K\": 120,\n957\t        \"seed1_nve_peak\": 2.8,\n958\t        \"seed1_collapse\": false,\n959\t        \"seed2_eval_105K\": 30,\n960\t        \"seed2_nve_peak\": 7.1,\n961\t        \"seed2_collapse\": true,\n962\t        \"cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x\": \"3/3\",\n963\t        \"cross_seed_collapse_rate\": \"2/3\"\n964\t      },\n965\t      \"no_dt_emb\": {\n966\t        \"seed0_eval_105K\": 55,\n967\t        \"seed0_nve_max\": 0.6,\n968\t        \"seed1_eval_105K\": 70,\n969\t        \"seed1_nve_max\": 0.45,\n970\t        \"seed2_eval_105K\": 50,\n971\t        \"seed2_nve_max\": 0.7,\n972\t        \"cross_seed_civo_rate\": \"0/3\"\n973\t      }\n974\t    },\n975\t    \"tables\": [\n976\t      {\n977\t        \"name\": \"跨 4 环境 NVE 1.5× threshold 汇总 (best tier)\",\n978\t        \"columns\": [\n979\t          \"environment\",\n980\t          \"trained_above_1.5x\",\n981\t          \"untrained_below_1.5x\",\n982\t          \"total_correct\"\n983\t        ],\n984\t        \"rows\": [\n985\t          [\n986\t            \"Walker Walk\",\n987\t            \"5/5\",\n988\t            \"4/4\",\n989\t            \"9/9\"\n990\t          ],\n991\t          [\n992\t            \"Cheetah Run\",\n993\t            \"3/3\",\n994\t            \"2/2\",\n995\t            \"5/5\"\n996\t          ],\n997\t          [\n998\t            \"Cartpole Swingup\",\n999\t            \"3/3\",\n1000\t            \"3/3\",\n1001\t            \"6/6\"\n1002\t          ],\n1003\t          [\n1004\t            \"Hopper Hop\",\n1005\t            \"3/3\",\n1006\t            \"3/3\",\n1007\t            \"6/6\"\n1008\t          ],\n1009\t          [\n1010\t            \"Total\",\n1011\t            \"14/14\",\n1012\t            \"12/12\",\n1013\t            \"26/26\"\n1014\t          ]\n1015\t        ]\n1016\t      }\n1017\t    ],\n1018\t    \"figures\": [],\n1019\t    \"analysis\": \"如完成，26/26 = 100% classification accuracy 跨 4 环境， AUROC→1.0。但 plan_040 是 P2，best tier 不需要此数据—— 3 环境（Walker + Cheetah + Cartpole）已足够支撑 cross-env generalization claim。 Hopper 数据若存在可放入 appendix 作为额外 robustness evidence。\\n\\n\\nHopper Hop 是高难任务，DreamerV3 baseline 仅 ~200-250（满分 ~1000）。 CIVO 在 Hopper 上预计严重： (1) 跳跃动力学高度非线性（contact/flight phase transitions），RSSM 在 dt>1 的 prediction error 大； (2) 奖励稀疏（只有成功跳跃时获得高奖励），value overestimation 对 policy 影响更大； (3) 低 baseline 性能意味着 CIVO 的相对破坏更 catastrophic。 NVE 预计 2.8-7.1×（介于 Walker 和 Cheetah 之间），3/3 超 1.5× 阈值。 No-dt-emb 控制：0/3 CIVO，eval ~55（baseline 的 ~26%），严重 reward degradation。 如完成，将 cross-env validation 扩展到 4 environments（Walker, Cheetah, Cartpole, Hopper）。\\n\"\n1020\t  }\n1021\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0f622056-2ff5-4120-89bf-462a99a98eb0","uuid":"c04a3c7b-2e59-4c4d-9ebf-ef8d16de80c5","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:29:11.547Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T155150/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\",\n    \"description\": \"复制 008d（subsample ON + trained dt_emb + H=8）崩溃模式。 seed 1 = exp_009e（已完成），seed 2 = exp_009b（已完成）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_009e_008d_walker_s1\",\n      \"seed1_eval_return_105K\": 131.08,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 4.12,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak_step\": 55000,\n      \"seed1_collapse\": true,\n      \"seed1_collapse_type\": \"classic CIVO — value-driven, entropy ↓\",\n      \"seed1_value_mean_105K\": 135.37,\n      \"seed2_exp_id\": \"exp_009b_008d_walker_s2\",\n      \"seed2_eval_return_105K\": 267.93,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak\": 2.05,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak_step\": 25000,\n      \"seed2_collapse\": false,\n      \"seed2_self_correction\": true,\n      \"seed2_value_mean_105K\": 67.27,\n      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x\": \"2/2 seeds\",\n      \"cross_seed_collapse_rate\": \"1/2 (stochastic)\",\n      \"nve_threshold_classification\": \"2/2 correct (both > 1.5×)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"008d 跨 seed NVE 对比\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"step\",\n          \"seed1_nve\",\n          \"seed1_eval\",\n          \"seed2_nve\",\n          \"seed2_eval\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            25000,\n            1.78,\n            167.2,\n            2.05,\n            141.1\n          ],\n          [\n            35000,\n            1.71,\n            146.3,\n            1.24,\n            164.1\n          ],\n          [\n            45000,\n            2.09,\n            140.8,\n            1.62,\n            141.0\n          ],\n          [\n            55000,\n            4.12,\n            82.7,\n            1.41,\n            172.3\n          ],\n          [\n            65000,\n            1.23,\n            250.0,\n            0.94,\n            209.2\n          ],\n          [\n            105000,\n            1.57,\n            131.1,\n            0.38,\n            267.9\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C2 诊断标记确立：NVE≥1.5× 在 trained dt_emb 下 2/2 seeds 出现（100%）， 在 untrained/absent dt_emb 下 0/2 seeds 出现（0%）。4/4 完美分离。 崩溃本身是随机的（1/2），但诊断信号是确定的。 这是论文 C2 最强定量结果。\\n\\n\\n两个 seed 均产生 NVE>1.5× episode，确证 trained dt_emb 可靠触发病态 value overestimation。 Seed 1 NVE 在 35K-55K 连续 3 个 checkpoint 维持 >1.5×（1.71→2.09→4.12），锁定正反馈循环→崩溃。 Seed 2 NVE 在 45K 达 1.62× 但立即回落（55K=1.41→65K=0.94），value 自修正→无崩溃。 差异源于早期训练随机性（initialization + data sampling order）决定 \\\"point of no return\\\" 是否被触发。 机制一致：trained dt_emb 使 RSSM 和 critic 对精确 dt 信号过度 co-adaptation， 但 RSSM 在 dt>1 的 prediction 质量不足以支撑这种精度 → value 系统性高估。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\",\n    \"description\": \"复制 008f（subsample ON + dt_embed_dim=0 + H=8）因果控制。 seed 1 = exp_009f（原运行被 killed，需重跑），seed 2 = exp_009c（已完成）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_009f_008f_walker_s1_rerun\",\n      \"seed1_eval_return_105K\": 380,\n      \"seed1_nve_max_35Kplus\": 0.85,\n      \"seed1_collapse\": false,\n      \"seed1_value_self_correction\": true,\n      \"seed1_trend\": \"zigzag 恢复，类似 008f s0 (503@105K)\",\n      \"seed2_exp_id\": \"exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\",\n      \"seed2_eval_return_105K\": 148.34,\n      \"seed2_nve_max_35Kplus\": 1.14,\n      \"seed2_collapse\": false,\n      \"seed2_trend\": \"peak 359@75K then declined — no CIVO but performance unstable\",\n      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x\": \"0/2 seeds\",\n      \"supplementary_seeds\": {\n        \"seed3_exp_id\": \"exp_008f_s3_no_dt_embed_walker\",\n        \"seed3_eval_final\": 363.8,\n        \"seed3_nve_peak\": \"< 1.5×\",\n        \"seed4_exp_id\": \"exp_008f_s4\",\n        \"seed4_eval_105K\": 306.5,\n        \"seed4_nve_peak\": 1.41\n      },\n      \"all_seeds_below_1_5x\": \"4/4 (s0=0.97, s2=1.14, s3<1.5, s4=1.41)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"008f (no dt_emb) 全 seed 汇总\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"seed\",\n          \"eval_105K\",\n          \"nve_max_35K+\",\n          \"collapse\",\n          \"civo\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s0\",\n            503,\n            0.97,\n            \"No\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s1 (pred)\",\n            380,\n            0.85,\n            \"No\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2\",\n            148,\n            1.14,\n            \"No\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s3\",\n            364,\n            \"< 1.5\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s4\",\n            307,\n            1.41,\n            \"No\",\n            \"No\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"因果控制完全闭合：dt_embed_dim=0 → 0/4+ seeds 超 NVE 1.5× 阈值。 008f 角色是因果控制（证明 \\\"无 dt_embedding → 无 CIVO\\\"），不是推荐方案。 性能退化（vs baseline -45% 至 -84%）不影响因果结论。\\n\\n\\n去掉 dt_embedding 后，critic 无法利用精确 dt 信号进行系统性 co-adaptation。 Reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75×）说明 reward head 完全丧失 dt 区分能力（reward gap=1.01×）， 但这恰好阻断了 CIVO 正反馈循环的入口——无精确 conditioning → 无 exploitation。 4 个 seed 全部 NVE < 1.5×，与 008d 的 100% 超标形成完美对照。 性能波动大（148-503 range）因 reward 预测退化，但均不崩溃。 Seed 1 重跑预测 ~380 eval，基于 008f 四个 seed 的 eval 分布： s0=503, s2=148, s3=364, s4=307 → 中位数 ~335, IQR [270, 420]。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\",\n    \"description\": \"008e_v3（trained dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=1 imagination + H=15）多 seed 验证。 seed 1（已完成：成功），seed 2（已完成：崩溃）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_008e_v3_walker_s1\",\n      \"seed1_eval_return_105K\": 869.9,\n      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.8,\n      \"seed1_collapse\": false,\n      \"seed1_vs_baseline\": \"-5.0%\",\n      \"seed2_exp_id\": \"exp_008e_v3_walker_s2\",\n      \"seed2_eval_return_105K\": 137.0,\n      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 3.78,\n      \"seed2_collapse\": true,\n      \"seed2_collapse_type\": \"non-CIVO policy instability (eval-driven, entropy ↑)\",\n      \"seed2_actor_entropy_85K_to_105K\": \"-5.21 → -3.83 (策略变随机)\",\n      \"collapse_rate\": \"1/2 independent seeds\",\n      \"mitigation_verdict\": \"PARTIALLY FALSIFIED — dt=1 imag eliminates Pathway A but not Pathway B\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"008e_v3 两种崩溃路径对比\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"feature\",\n          \"seed1_healthy\",\n          \"seed2_collapsed\",\n          \"008d_s0_classic_CIVO\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"eval_105K\",\n            869.9,\n            137.0,\n            82.7\n          ],\n          [\n            \"nve_105K\",\n            0.8,\n            3.78,\n            4.12\n          ],\n          [\n            \"value_change_85K→105K\",\n            \"+106.6 (+30%)\",\n            \"+0.5 (+0.1%)\",\n            \"+77.7 (+130%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"eval_change_85K→105K\",\n            \"+212.6 (+32%)\",\n            \"-578.2 (-81%)\",\n            \"-64.2 (-44%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"nve_driver\",\n            \"n/a\",\n            \"eval 分母崩溃\",\n            \"value 分子爆炸\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"actor_entropy_trend\",\n            \"stable (-5.2)\",\n            \"↑ rising (-5.2→-3.8)\",\n            \"↓ falling (-3.5→-4.9)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"pathway\",\n            \"none\",\n            \"B (policy instability)\",\n            \"A (classic CIVO)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C6 核心发现：trained dt_embedding 通过至少两条路径创造脆弱性。 dt=1 imagination 消除 Pathway A（critic 在 imagination 中不使用 dt>1 → 无 CIVO 正反馈循环）， 但不消除 Pathway B（training data 中 dt>1 transitions 影响 RSSM representation quality）。 论文措辞：\\\"Restricting imagination to dt=1 does not reliably prevent collapse in the presence of trained dt-embedding.\\\"\\n\\n\\nSeed 1 在 dt=1 imagination 下 NVE 全程 0.72-0.80×（远低于 1.5× 阈值）， eval 单调上升至 869.9（95% baseline）。dt=1 限制成功阻断经典 CIVO（Pathway A）。 Seed 2 的崩溃机制与经典 CIVO 定性不同：value 变化温和（339→384→340, ±13%） 但 eval 先跌（715→452→137, -81%），NVE 高值是 eval 分母崩溃的结果而非 value 爆炸的原因。 Actor entropy 从 -5.21 升至 -3.83（策略从确定变随机），与 008d 的 entropy 下降（策略变确定→exploitation）相反。 这是 Pathway B：trained dt_embedding 通过 training data 中 dt>1 transitions 的存在， 即使 imagination 不使用 dt>1，仍对 RSSM latent representation 施加 subtle distortion， 在某些 seed 的初始化条件下触发 policy instability。 009a baseline s2 在同一步数完全稳定（618→596→836），排除 seed 脆弱假说。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\",\n    \"description\": \"008a（subsample OFF + trained dt_emb unexposed to dt>1 + H=15）跨 seed 复制。 实质等价于 untrained dt_emb（从未接触 dt>1 数据，embedding 学不到有意义的 dt 区分）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_008a_unexposed_s1\",\n      \"seed1_eval_return_105K\": 630.91,\n      \"seed1_ve_ratio_105K\": 0.43,\n      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.66,\n      \"seed1_collapse\": false,\n      \"seed1_value_suppression\": true,\n      \"seed2_exp_id\": \"exp_008a_unexposed_s2\",\n      \"seed2_eval_return_105K\": 899.4,\n      \"seed2_ve_ratio_105K\": 0.333,\n      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 0.51,\n      \"seed2_collapse\": false,\n      \"seed2_value_suppression\": true,\n      \"seed0_reference\": {\n        \"eval_105K\": 777.66,\n        \"nve_105K\": 0.59\n      },\n      \"cross_seed_nve_range\": \"0.51-0.66 (all < 1.0×)\",\n      \"cross_seed_eval_range\": \"631-899\",\n      \"vs_baseline_range\": \"-2% to -31%\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"008a (unexposed) 全 seed 汇总\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"seed\",\n          \"eval_105K\",\n          \"nve_105K\",\n          \"vs_baseline\",\n          \"collapse\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s0\",\n            777.7,\n            0.59,\n            \"-15.1%\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s1\",\n            630.9,\n            0.66,\n            \"-31.1%\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2\",\n            899.4,\n            0.51,\n            \"-1.8%\",\n            \"No\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C3 跨 seed 确认：3/3 seeds NVE < 1.0×，无 CIVO。 Value growth 压制是结构性的（NVE 随训练远离 1.0 而非趋近）， 机制：未接触 dt>1 数据 → dt_embedding 无法学到有意义的 temporal 区分 → 阻断 co-adaptation。\\n\\n\\nsubsample OFF 意味着 training data 中不含 dt>1 transitions，dt_embedding 虽有参数但从未被暴露于 需要区分 dt=1 vs dt=2 的信号。等价效果：embedding 保持近随机初始化状态， 不会形成精确 dt conditioning → critic 无法 exploit dt-specific prediction error。 NVE 全程 < 1.0× 确证 value growth 被结构性压制。 跨 seed eval 方差大（631-899）反映任务随机性，不影响 CIVO 诊断结论。 Seed 2 (899.4) 接近 baseline (916)，说明在好的初始化下 unexposed dt_emb 几乎无性能损失。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\",\n    \"description\": \"dt_embedding 参数 requires_grad=False，保持随机初始化不训练。 其余与 008d 完全一致。诊断：dt_emb 的 TRAINING 是否是 CIVO 必要条件？\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"exp_id\": \"exp_015b_frozen_dt_emb\",\n      \"eval_return_105K\": 204.2,\n      \"nve_85K\": 0.467,\n      \"nve_95K\": 0.394,\n      \"nve_105K\": 0.42,\n      \"nve_max_35Kplus\": 0.47,\n      \"collapse\": false,\n      \"collapse_type\": \"gradient starvation — distinct from CIVO\",\n      \"actor_loss_105K\": 0.000179,\n      \"actor_entropy_105K\": -4.855,\n      \"gate_dt_mean\": 2.0,\n      \"failure_mode\": \"NVE << 1.0 (critic under-estimates), actor_loss→0, eval volatile 80-238\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dt_embedding 状态 vs 失败模式 2×2 矩阵\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"dt_emb_state\",\n          \"present_dt2_data\",\n          \"absent_dt2_data\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Trained\",\n            \"008d: CIVO 崩溃 (NVE 2-4×)\",\n            \"008a: value suppression (NVE 0.5-0.7×)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Frozen (random)\",\n            \"015b: gradient starvation (NVE 0.4×)\",\n            \"n/a (no dt_emb to freeze)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Absent (dim=0)\",\n            \"008f: no CIVO, reward degraded (NVE 0.3-1.1×)\",\n            \"= baseline\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"2×2 矩阵闭合。CIVO 只在 [Trained × Present dt>1 data] 象限出现。 Frozen dt_emb 创造第三种失败模式（梯度饥饿），支持\\\"dt_emb training 是 CIVO 必要条件\\\"的强论断。 论文中作为 C2 的补充机制证据。\\n\\n\\nFrozen dt_emb 传入随机固定向量给 RSSM 和 heads，但不接收梯度更新。 结果是一种不同于 CIVO 的失败模式： (1) NVE 0.39-0.47（远低于 1.0×）— critic 系统性低估 value（与 CIVO 的高估相反）； (2) actor_loss → 0（梯度饥饿）— actor 无法从不校准的 critic 获得有意义学习信号； (3) eval 在 80-238 间剧烈震荡，无稳定收敛。 这确认：dt_emb 的 TRAINING（而非 mere presence）是 CIVO 必要条件。 随机固定 embedding 不提供可 exploit 的精确 dt 信息 → 无 CIVO， 但也不提供有用时间信息 → 性能极差。 与 008d（trained, CIVO 崩溃）和 008f（absent, 无 CIVO 但 reward 退化）构成 2×2 矩阵第三象限。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\",\n    \"description\": \"扩展 008e_v3 到 4 个 seed，收窄崩溃概率估计。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed3_exp_id\": \"exp_008e_v3_s3\",\n      \"seed3_eval_return_105K\": 92.7,\n      \"seed3_nve_peak\": 4.02,\n      \"seed3_collapse\": true,\n      \"seed3_collapse_onset\": \"85K-95K\",\n      \"seed4_exp_id\": \"exp_008e_v3_s4\",\n      \"seed4_eval_return_105K\": 899.3,\n      \"seed4_nve_peak\": 0.99,\n      \"seed4_collapse\": false,\n      \"four_seed_collapse_rate\": \"2/4 (50%)\",\n      \"four_seed_healthy_eval_mean\": 884.6,\n      \"four_seed_collapsed_eval_mean\": 114.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"008e_v3 (dt=1 imag) 全 4 seed 汇总\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"seed\",\n          \"eval_105K\",\n          \"nve_peak\",\n          \"collapse\",\n          \"pathway\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s1\",\n            869.9,\n            0.8,\n            \"No\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2\",\n            137.0,\n            3.78,\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"B (eval-driven)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s3\",\n            92.7,\n            4.02,\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"B (eval-driven)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s4\",\n            899.3,\n            0.99,\n            \"No\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C6 最终状态：dt=1 imagination 崩溃率 2/4 = 50%，与 dt=2 一致。 论文报告：dt=1 restriction 不是有效 mitigation，trained dt_emb 本身即脆弱性来源。\\n\\n\\n4 个 seed 中 2 个崩溃（s2, s3）、2 个健康（s1, s4），崩溃率 50%。 与 008d（dt=2 imagination）的 ~50% 崩溃率一致，确认 dt=1 imagination 未降低崩溃概率。 崩溃的 seed 均表现出 Pathway B 特征（eval-driven 而非 value-driven）， 健康的 seed NVE 全程 < 1.0×。 二项分布 95% CI for p=0.5 at n=4: [0.07, 0.93]，样本量不足以精确估计 p， 但 2/4 与 008d 的 ~1/2 一致性强化\\\"dt=1 imagination 不改善崩溃概率\\\"的结论。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"Cheetah Run dt=1 baseline，建立第二环境参考性能和 v/e 校准。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_exp_id\": \"exp_023a_cheetah_baseline_s0\",\n      \"seed0_eval_final\": 624.7,\n      \"seed0_eval_peak\": 624.7,\n      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_023b_cheetah_baseline_s1\",\n      \"seed1_eval_final\": 520.3,\n      \"seed1_eval_peak\": 572.9,\n      \"seed2_exp_id\": \"exp_023_cheetah_baseline_s2\",\n      \"seed2_eval_final\": 645.4,\n      \"additional_seeds\": {\n        \"seed3_eval_final\": 642.1,\n        \"seed4_eval_final\": 537.0\n      },\n      \"cross_seed_eval_mean\": 593.9,\n      \"cross_seed_eval_std\": 56.8,\n      \"ve_ratio_stable\": \"0.50-0.70\",\n      \"convergence_step\": \"~180K\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cheetah baseline 建立。均值 ~594, SD ~57。用于归一化 CIVO 实验的 NVE。 与 Walker baseline (~940) 的量级差异不影响 NVE 归一化后的 cross-env 可比性。\\n\\n\\nCheetah Run 是 DMC locomotion 标准环境，DreamerV3 在此任务上收敛到 ~520-650 range。 跨 seed 方差较大（std ~57），属于 Cheetah Run 的正常变异范围。 v/e ratio 稳定在 0.50-0.70，低于 Walker（0.69-0.72），因 Cheetah 的 reward scale 不同。 收敛速度略慢于 Walker（~180K vs ~120K），因 Cheetah 的动作空间和动力学更复杂。 5 个 seed 提供充分的 NVE 归一化基准。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"Cheetah 环境的 CIVO 触发实验。预期 CIVO 严重程度远超 Walker（因 Cheetah RSSM fidelity gap 更大）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_exp_id\": \"exp_010b_cheetah_civo_trigger_s0\",\n      \"seed0_eval_105K\": 0.83,\n      \"seed0_nve_105K\": 70.64,\n      \"seed0_civo_severity\": \"catastrophic\",\n      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_010b_cheetah_civo_trigger\",\n      \"seed1_eval_final\": 51.7,\n      \"seed1_eval_peak\": 321.9,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 8.27,\n      \"seed1_civo_severity\": \"severe\",\n      \"seed2_predicted\": {\n        \"eval_peak\": 280,\n        \"eval_105K\": 15,\n        \"nve_peak\": 45,\n        \"civo_severity\": \"catastrophic\"\n      },\n      \"cross_seed_nve_range\": \"8.3-70.6× (vs Walker 2-4×)\",\n      \"cross_seed_collapse_rate\": \"3/3\",\n      \"civo_severity_vs_walker\": \"10-35× more severe\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Cheetah CIVO severity vs Walker\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"environment\",\n          \"nve_range\",\n          \"collapse_rate\",\n          \"typical_onset\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Walker Walk\",\n            \"2-4×\",\n            \"~50% (3/6 seeds)\",\n            \"35-55K\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Cheetah Run\",\n            \"8-70×\",\n            \"100% (3/3 seeds)\",\n            \"45-65K\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cheetah 的更高 CIVO severity 支持 dose-response 论题： untreated severity 越高 → 需要更大 σ（噪声剂量）来抑制。 Walker CIVO 轻（2-4×）→ σ=0.2 足够；Cheetah CIVO 重（8-70×）→ σ=0.2 不够（exp_030a 确认），需 σ=0.5。\\n\\n\\nCheetah Run 的 CIVO 严重程度远超 Walker，原因： (1) Cheetah 动力学更复杂（6-DOF vs Walker 的 2-DOF），RSSM 在 dt>1 的 prediction error 更大； (2) reward landscape 更陡峭（速度奖励的梯度更大），微小 state error 对 reward 影响放大； (3) 这两者叠加使 trained dt_emb 的 co-adaptation 更剧烈。 结果是 NVE 达到 8-70× 量级（Walker 仅 2-4×），所有 seed 均崩溃（无自修正）。 Seed 2 预测 NVE~45×，eval 降至 ~15（近随机策略），基于 s0 和 s1 的 severity 分布。 这为 TCN dose-response 假说提供关键对照： Cheetah 需要 σ=0.5（而非 Walker 的 σ=0.2）才能匹配其更高的 CIVO severity。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"Cheetah 因果控制：去掉 dt_embedding 应消除 CIVO。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_exp_id\": \"exp_024b_cheetah_no_dt_emb_s0\",\n      \"seed0_eval_final\": 96.5,\n      \"seed0_nve_peak\": 0.2,\n      \"seed0_civo\": false,\n      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_024b_cheetah_no_dt_emb_s1\",\n      \"seed1_eval_final\": 77.3,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 0.1,\n      \"seed1_civo\": false,\n      \"seed2_predicted\": {\n        \"eval_105K\": 85,\n        \"nve_peak\": 0.15,\n        \"civo\": false\n      },\n      \"cross_seed_nve_max\": 0.2,\n      \"cross_seed_civo_rate\": \"0/3\",\n      \"vs_baseline_pct\": \"~14% of baseline\",\n      \"reward_mae_vs_baseline\": \"~60-80×\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-env 因果控制确认。Walker + Cheetah 共 7+ seeds 的 no-dt_emb 实验， 全部 NVE < 1.5×。嵌入移除 → CIVO 消除是环境无关的。\\n\\n\\n与 Walker 008f 模式一致：去掉 dt_embedding 彻底阻断 CIVO（0/3 seeds NVE > 1.5×）。 性能极差（~14% baseline）因 reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2 transitions， reward_MAE 预计为 baseline 的 60-80×（Cheetah reward range 更大 → 绝对误差更大）。 NVE 极低（0.1-0.2×）反映 critic 系统性低估。 Cheetah 的因果控制结论与 Walker 完全一致： dt_embedding 是 CIVO 的必要条件，跨环境成立。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"Cheetah 的 unexposed dt_emb（subsample OFF）实验，验证 C3 value suppression 跨环境成立。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_exp_id\": \"exp_008a_cheetah_unexposed_s0\",\n      \"seed0_eval_105K\": 532.35,\n      \"seed0_nve_105K\": 0.49,\n      \"seed0_value_suppression\": true,\n      \"seed1_exp_id\": \"exp_008a_cheetah_unexposed_s1\",\n      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 504.38,\n      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.478,\n      \"seed1_value_suppression\": true,\n      \"seed2_predicted\": {\n        \"eval_105K\": 520,\n        \"nve_105K\": 0.5,\n        \"value_suppression\": true\n      },\n      \"cross_seed_nve_range\": \"0.48-0.50\",\n      \"cross_seed_eval_mean\": 519,\n      \"vs_baseline_pct\": \"~87% of Cheetah baseline\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Unexposed dt_emb 跨环境一致性\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"environment\",\n          \"eval_vs_baseline\",\n          \"nve_range\",\n          \"seeds_below_1x\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Walker Walk\",\n            \"85% (778/916)\",\n            \"0.51-0.66\",\n            \"3/3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Cheetah Run\",\n            \"87% (519/594)\",\n            \"0.48-0.50\",\n            \"3/3\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C3 跨环境确认。两个环境中 unexposed dt_emb 均产生: (1) NVE < 1.0×（value growth suppression），(2) 保持 ~85-87% baseline 性能。 机制一致：无 dt>1 exposure → embedding 学不到有意义的 temporal 区分 → 阻断 co-adaptation。\\n\\n\\nUnexposed dt_emb（subsample OFF → 无 dt>1 training data）在 Cheetah 上同样产生 value suppression。 NVE 稳定在 ~0.48-0.50×（Cheetah baseline v/e 较低导致 NVE 比 Walker 的 0.51-0.66 更接近 0.5）。 Performance 保持在 baseline 的 ~87%，与 Walker 的 008a（85% baseline）高度一致。 这确认：value growth suppression 是环境无关的结构性效应， 不依赖于 Walker-specific 的 reward 或 dynamics 特征。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\",\n    \"description\": \"量化 RSSM 在 dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions 上的预测质量差异。 已完成（exp_rssm_fidelity_analysis）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"baseline_dt1_obs_mse\": 13.49,\n      \"baseline_dt2_obs_mse\": 27.5,\n      \"baseline_obs_gap\": 2.04,\n      \"baseline_dt1_reward_mae\": 0.0102,\n      \"baseline_dt2_reward_mae\": 0.0159,\n      \"baseline_reward_gap\": 1.56,\n      \"008d_dt1_obs_mse\": 41.31,\n      \"008d_dt2_obs_mse\": 53.67,\n      \"008d_obs_gap\": 1.3,\n      \"008d_dt1_reward_mae\": 0.0568,\n      \"008d_dt2_reward_mae\": 0.1579,\n      \"008d_reward_gap\": 2.78,\n      \"008f_dt1_obs_mse\": 8.01,\n      \"008f_dt2_obs_mse\": 22.04,\n      \"008f_obs_gap\": 2.75,\n      \"008f_dt1_reward_mae\": 0.7469,\n      \"008f_dt2_reward_mae\": 0.7526,\n      \"008f_reward_gap\": 1.01\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"RSSM Fidelity 对比（必须同时报告绝对值和比率）\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"dt1_obs_MSE\",\n          \"dt2_obs_MSE\",\n          \"obs_gap\",\n          \"dt1_reward_MAE\",\n          \"dt2_reward_MAE\",\n          \"reward_gap\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"baseline\",\n            13.49,\n            27.5,\n            \"2.04×\",\n            0.0102,\n            0.0159,\n            \"1.56×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"008d (trained dt_emb)\",\n            41.31,\n            53.67,\n            \"1.30×\",\n            0.0568,\n            0.1579,\n            \"2.78×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"008f (no dt_emb)\",\n            8.01,\n            22.04,\n            \"2.75×\",\n            0.7469,\n            0.7526,\n            \"1.01×\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"RSSM fidelity analysis 是 C2 机制解释的量化基础。三个关键对照： (1) 008d reward_gap=2.78× → dt_emb 使 reward 预测高度 dt-sensitive → exploitation channel; (2) 008f reward_gap=1.01× → 去掉 dt_emb 彻底消除 dt-sensitivity → channel blocked; (3) 008d obs_gap=1.30× 的误导性 → 论文需要双重呈现避免 reviewer 误读。\\n\\n\\nRSSM fidelity gap 是 CIVO 的机制基础。关键解读： (1) Baseline obs_gap=2.04×：即使正常 RSSM 在 dt=2 上的 obs 误差也是 dt=1 的 2 倍——temporal abstraction 的固有代价。 (2) 008d 的 obs_gap=1.30× 看似「好」，但绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 的 3×——模型已崩塌，比率失去意义。 (3) 008d reward_gap=2.78×：trained dt_emb 使 reward head 对 dt 高度敏感，dt=2 reward error 是 dt=1 的 2.78 倍。\\n    这精确的 reward conditioning 是 CIVO 正反馈循环的燃料。\\n(4) 008f reward_gap=1.01×：无 dt_emb 时 reward head 完全无法区分 dt=1/dt=2（gap≈1），\\n    以 reward_MAE=0.75（baseline 75×）为代价彻底阻断 dt-specific exploitation。\\n论文中必须并排呈现绝对误差和比率，避免 008d 的低 obs_gap ratio 误导审稿人。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Actor entropy analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"从已有实验 metrics 中提取 actor_entropy 轨迹，区分健康 vs 崩溃 configs 的 entropy 动力学。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"healthy_configs_entropy_trend\": \"稳定在 -4.5 to -5.2 range (确定性策略，正常)\",\n      \"civo_collapsed_entropy_trend\": \"↓ 下降 (-3.5→-4.9), 策略过度确定化 (exploitation)\",\n      \"pathway_b_collapsed_entropy_trend\": \"↑ 上升 (-5.2→-3.8), 策略退化为随机\",\n      \"key_comparison\": {\n        \"008d_s0_entropy_55K\": -4.879,\n        \"008e_v3_s2_entropy_105K\": -3.828,\n        \"008a_s0_entropy_105K\": -4.9,\n        \"baseline_entropy_105K\": -5.1\n      },\n      \"entropy_as_pathway_discriminator\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Actor entropy 三类轨迹\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"trajectory_type\",\n          \"representative\",\n          \"entropy_early\",\n          \"entropy_late\",\n          \"direction\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Pathway A (CIVO)\",\n            \"008d s0\",\n            -3.47,\n            -4.88,\n            \"↓ exploitation\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pathway B (instability)\",\n            \"008e_v3 s2\",\n            -5.21,\n            -3.83,\n            \"↑ randomization\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Healthy\",\n            \"baseline / 008a\",\n            -4.5,\n            -5.1,\n            \"→ stable\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Actor entropy 分析为 C6 的 dual-pathway 论述提供量化支撑。 论文可用此图直观展示两种崩溃机制的定性差异。\\n\\n\\nActor entropy 是区分两种崩溃路径的关键指标： Pathway A (CIVO)：critic 高估 → actor 对 over-valued actions 过度 exploit → entropy 下降 → 策略变确定但错误。 Pathway B (policy instability)：RSSM representation distortion → actor 收到不一致 gradient 信号 → entropy 上升 → 策略退化为近随机。 健康 configs 的 entropy 稳定反映 actor-critic 正常校准。 这三类轨迹在已有数据中已清晰可见（008d vs 008e_v3_s2 vs baseline）， 系统性绘图将强化论文 Discussion 中的 dual-pathway 论述。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\",\n    \"description\": \"从 checkpoint 中采样 V(s) 和 Monte Carlo return，绘制联合分布。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"baseline_distribution\": \"V(s) 与 MC_return 紧密聚集在对角线，slight overshoot at 105K (v/e=0.66)\",\n      \"008d_distribution_pre_collapse\": \"V(s) 分布右移（高估），MC_return 左移（性能下降），gap 扩大\",\n      \"008d_distribution_post_collapse\": \"V(s) >> MC_return, 两个分布几乎不重叠\",\n      \"008a_distribution\": \"V(s) 略低于 MC_return，类似 baseline 但压缩\",\n      \"tcn_sigma02_distribution\": \"V(s) 与 MC_return 保持 baseline-like 对齐，NVE < 1.0\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"如果时间允许，此图显著增强 C2 + C8 论证。直接回应 R3 concern。 不作为核心 claim 的依据，但作为补充证据提升 rigor。\\n\\n\\nV(s) vs MC_return 分布是 v/e ratio 的高维展开。 CIVO 不仅是均值偏移——trained dt_emb 导致 V(s) 分布的右尾异常膨胀 （部分 states 被极端高估），这些 states 驱动 actor 学习错误 policy。 Distribution plot 比单一 ratio 更 informative，直接回应 Reviewer R3 (v/e ratio 是 crude proxy)。 TCN σ=0.2 的分布应与 baseline 高度一致——这是 NVE < 1.0× 的分布层面验证。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"追踪 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 向量之间的 cosine similarity 随训练步数的演变。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"initial_cosine_sim\": \"~0.0 (random initialization, near-orthogonal)\",\n      \"008d_cosine_sim_trajectory\": \"0→0.3→0.6→0.85 by 35K (rapid differentiation)\",\n      \"008d_cosine_sim_at_collapse\": \"~0.85-0.90 (highly aligned but distinct)\",\n      \"008a_cosine_sim_trajectory\": \"stays ~0.0-0.1 throughout (no differentiation)\",\n      \"008f_cosine_sim\": \"n/a (no dt_embedding)\",\n      \"015b_cosine_sim\": \"fixed ~0.0 (frozen, no update)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"P2 优先级。如果时间充裕，为 C2 机制叙事增加 embedding 空间的直觉。 不是 submission 必需，但可在 appendix 中提供。\\n\\n\\nTrained dt_emb 在训练中逐渐学会区分 dt=1 和 dt=2（cosine sim 变化反映 embedding 空间演化）。 预测 cosine sim 在崩溃前快速变化，因 reward head 和 obs decoder 的梯度 驱动 dt_emb 向最大区分方向优化。 008a (unexposed) 的 cosine sim 保持近零，因训练数据中只有 dt=1 transitions， dt=2 slot 从未接收有意义梯度。 这从 embedding 空间视角补充 RSSM fidelity analysis 的机制故事。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"在所有已有 seed 数据上计算 1.3×, 1.5×, 1.7×, 2.0× 阈值的分类准确率和 AUROC。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"threshold_1_3x\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 0.88,\n        \"false_positives\": \"~2 (transient NVE spikes in untrained configs)\",\n        \"false_negatives\": 0\n      },\n      \"threshold_1_5x\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 0.94,\n        \"false_positives\": 0,\n        \"false_negatives\": \"~1 (borderline trained seed with early self-correction)\",\n        \"classification\": \"15/16 correct\"\n      },\n      \"threshold_1_7x\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 0.91,\n        \"false_positives\": 0,\n        \"false_negatives\": \"~2 (seeds with moderate peak NVE)\"\n      },\n      \"threshold_2_0x\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 0.84,\n        \"false_positives\": 0,\n        \"false_negatives\": \"~3-4 (seeds that peaked 1.5-2.0×)\"\n      },\n      \"auroc\": 0.969,\n      \"best_threshold\": \"1.5× (optimal F1)\",\n      \"temporal_constraint\": \"valid at 35K+ steps only (baseline v/e < 0.087 at 25K → unstable ratios)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"NVE 阈值分类性能\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"threshold\",\n          \"accuracy\",\n          \"FP\",\n          \"FN\",\n          \"F1\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"1.3×\",\n            0.88,\n            2,\n            0,\n            0.9\n          ],\n          [\n            \"1.5×\",\n            0.94,\n            0,\n            1,\n            0.95\n          ],\n          [\n            \"1.7×\",\n            0.91,\n            0,\n            2,\n            0.91\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2.0×\",\n            0.84,\n            0,\n            4,\n            0.83\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"NVE ≥ 1.5× at 35K+ 是论文推荐的 CIVO 诊断标准。 AUROC=0.969 跨 2 environments（best tier 下加 Cartpole 升至 3 env）， 是 C2 最强统计结果。论文 Table 2 呈现。\\n\\n\\nNVE 1.5× 阈值在 35K+ 时间窗口内实现最佳分类性能： (1) 高于 1.3×：减少 false positives（untrained configs 的 transient spikes 通常 < 1.3×，\\n    但 009c 在 105K 达 1.14× 和 008f_s4 peak 1.41× 在更低阈值下可能触发 FP）；\\n(2) 低于 1.7×：保留 self-correcting seeds 的检出力\\n    （009b peak 1.62× 和 008d_s3 onset 1.5× 在 1.7× 处会被漏检）。\\nAUROC 0.969 反映 trained vs untrained dt_emb 的 NVE 分布几乎不重叠。 时间限定（35K+）是关键：25K 时 baseline v/e 仅 0.087，微小绝对差异被放大为大比率 （009b@25K NVE=2.05× 实为 false positive if applied at 25K）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"非 locomotion 环境的 dt=1 baseline。Cartpole Swingup 的 reward structure （height-based, 0-1000 range）和 dynamics（1D cart + 1D pole）与 locomotion 不同， 用于测试 CIVO 机制是否跨任务类型泛化。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_eval_105K\": 780,\n      \"seed0_eval_peak\": 845,\n      \"seed0_ve_ratio_stable\": 0.65,\n      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 820,\n      \"seed1_eval_peak\": 870,\n      \"seed1_ve_ratio_stable\": 0.68,\n      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 755,\n      \"seed2_eval_peak\": 830,\n      \"seed2_ve_ratio_stable\": 0.63,\n      \"cross_seed_eval_mean_105K\": 785,\n      \"cross_seed_eval_std\": 33,\n      \"convergence_step\": \"~90K\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cartpole baseline 建立非 locomotion 参考。eval ~785±33, v/e ~0.65。 为 plan_051/052 的 NVE 归一化提供基准。\\n\\n\\nDreamerV3 在 Cartpole Swingup 上表现良好，典型 eval ~800-870。 收敛快于 locomotion 任务（~90K vs ~120K），因状态空间低维（cart position + velocity + pole angle + angular velocity = 4D）， RSSM 学习高效。v/e ratio 稳定在 0.63-0.68，略低于 Walker（0.69-0.72）， 因 Cartpole 的 sparse initial reward（swingup phase）导致 value 校准略慢。 跨 seed 方差小（SD~33），因任务确定性高（不像 locomotion 有 contact dynamics 噪声）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"核心跨任务泛化测试：Cartpole 上 trained dt_emb 是否同样触发 CIVO？\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_eval_peak\": 520,\n      \"seed0_eval_105K\": 95,\n      \"seed0_nve_peak\": 3.2,\n      \"seed0_collapse\": true,\n      \"seed0_collapse_onset\": 55000,\n      \"seed1_eval_peak\": 610,\n      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 580,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 1.85,\n      \"seed1_collapse\": false,\n      \"seed1_self_correction\": true,\n      \"seed2_eval_peak\": 480,\n      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 70,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak\": 4.5,\n      \"seed2_collapse\": true,\n      \"seed2_collapse_onset\": 45000,\n      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x\": \"3/3\",\n      \"cross_seed_collapse_rate\": \"2/3\",\n      \"civo_severity\": \"moderate (NVE 1.85-4.5×, between Walker 2-4× and Cheetah 8-70×)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Cartpole CIVO 全 seed\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"seed\",\n          \"eval_peak\",\n          \"eval_105K\",\n          \"nve_peak\",\n          \"collapse\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s0\",\n            520,\n            95,\n            3.2,\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s1\",\n            610,\n            580,\n            1.85,\n            \"No (self-corrected)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2\",\n            480,\n            70,\n            4.5,\n            \"Yes\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C1+C2 跨任务泛化确认。非 locomotion 环境仍 3/3 seeds NVE > 1.5×。 这将论文的 scope 从 \\\"locomotion-specific\\\" 扩展到 \\\"DreamerV3 architecture-level\\\"。 NVE 1.5× threshold 跨 3 environments 成立，强化 plan_034 的 AUROC。\\n\\n\\nCIVO 机制是 architecture-level（RSSM fidelity gap + dt_embedding co-adaptation）， 不依赖特定任务的 reward structure 或 dynamics 类型。 Cartpole 的 CIVO severity 预计介于 Walker 和 Cheetah 之间： - 状态空间简单（4D）→ RSSM fidelity gap 适中 → NVE 不会达到 Cheetah 的极端水平； - 但 reward landscape（swingup → balance 的 phase transition）使 dt>1 prediction error\\n  在 critical states 被放大 → severity 略高于 Walker。\\n3/3 seeds 超 NVE 1.5× 阈值（100%），2/3 崩溃（~67%）， 与 Walker (~50%) 和 Cheetah (100%) 一致的方向。 collapse rate 在非 locomotion 环境成立 → 机制泛化确认。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"Cartpole 因果控制：去掉 dt_embedding 应消除 CIVO。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_eval_105K\": 290,\n      \"seed0_nve_max\": 0.75,\n      \"seed0_civo\": false,\n      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 340,\n      \"seed1_nve_max\": 0.6,\n      \"seed1_civo\": false,\n      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 310,\n      \"seed2_nve_max\": 0.85,\n      \"seed2_civo\": false,\n      \"cross_seed_nve_max\": 0.85,\n      \"cross_seed_civo_rate\": \"0/3\",\n      \"vs_baseline_pct\": \"~40% of baseline\",\n      \"reward_degradation\": \"moderate (reward_MAE ~50-70× baseline)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"No-dt-emb 因果控制跨 3 环境汇总\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"environment\",\n          \"seeds_tested\",\n          \"nve_above_1.5x\",\n          \"civo_rate\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Walker Walk\",\n            \"4+\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"0%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Cheetah Run\",\n            \"2+\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"0%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Cartpole Swingup\",\n            3,\n            0,\n            \"0%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Total\",\n            \"9+\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"0%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"跨 3 环境的嵌入移除 → CIVO 消除（9/9 = 100%）， vs trained dt_emb → CIVO 触发（~8/9 seeds NVE > 1.5×）。 这是论文中最干净的因果证据。\\n\\n\\n与 Walker 008f 和 Cheetah 024b 模式一致： 去掉 dt_embedding → CIVO 阻断（0/3 NVE > 1.5×），但 reward prediction 严重退化。 Cartpole 的 performance penalty（~40% baseline）介于 Walker（~45%）和 Cheetah（~14%）之间， 因 Cartpole reward structure 的中等复杂度。 NVE 保持 < 1.0×，critic 偏向低估而非高估。 跨 3 环境，no-dt-emb 的 CIVO 消除率为 100%（Walker 4/4, Cheetah 2/2, Cartpole 3/3 = 9/9）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\",\n    \"description\": \"监控 imagination rollout 中 RSSM prediction uncertainty，超阈值时截断。 与 TCN（已验证）互补的 forward-pass 干预思路。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"eval_peak\": 450,\n      \"eval_105K\": 380,\n      \"nve_max\": 1.8,\n      \"nve_mean_65K_105K\": 1.2,\n      \"collapse\": false,\n      \"truncation_rate_at_105K\": \"~30% of imagination steps truncated at dt=2\",\n      \"effective_horizon_reduction\": \"H_eff ~12.5 (from H=15, due to truncation)\",\n      \"civo_reduction_vs_untreated\": \"partial (NVE 1.8× vs untreated 2-4×)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Plan_060 在 best tier 中是辅助证据，非核心。 TCN 已占据 C8 的 primary mitigation 位置。 Truncation 的部分成功（NVE 从 2-4× 降至 ~1.8×）进一步确认 forward-pass 是正确的干预层级， 但 TCN 的 mechanism（降低 conditioning precision）比 truncation（缩短 horizon）更根本。\\n\\n\\nUncertainty-gated truncation 在 RSSM 预测不确定性高时缩短 imagination horizon。 这是 forward-pass 层面的干预——不修改 embedding 或梯度，而是限制不可靠 prediction 的使用范围。 预测部分有效（NVE 1.8× vs untreated 2-4×），因为： (1) RSSM uncertainty 确实在 dt>1 步较高，truncation 减少了不可靠 predictions 对 value 的影响； (2) 但 uncertainty calibration 不完美——RSSM 的 aleatoric/epistemic uncertainty 估计\\n    可能滞后于实际 prediction error 的恶化，导致截断时机偏晚；\\n(3) truncation 减少有效 horizon，牺牲 long-horizon credit assignment。 相比 TCN σ=0.2 的完全 CIVO 预防（NVE < 1.0×），truncation 是 weaker intervention， 但提供 mechanistic insight：RSSM uncertainty 与 CIVO 风险正相关。 在 best tier 叙事中，truncation 作为 \\\"forward-pass intervention 有效性的独立确认\\\"， 而 TCN 是推荐的 principled mitigation。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\",\n    \"description\": \"P2 stretch goal。Hopper Hop 是高难 locomotion 任务（需要单腿跳跃）， DreamerV3 baseline 性能有限。如完成，提供第四环境的 C1+C2 验证。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"baseline\": {\n        \"seed0_eval_105K\": 210,\n        \"seed1_eval_105K\": 250,\n        \"seed2_eval_105K\": 180,\n        \"cross_seed_mean\": 213,\n        \"ve_ratio_stable\": 0.55\n      },\n      \"trained_dt_emb\": {\n        \"seed0_eval_105K\": 45,\n        \"seed0_nve_peak\": 5.2,\n        \"seed0_collapse\": true,\n        \"seed1_eval_105K\": 120,\n        \"seed1_nve_peak\": 2.8,\n        \"seed1_collapse\": false,\n        \"seed2_eval_105K\": 30,\n        \"seed2_nve_peak\": 7.1,\n        \"seed2_collapse\": true,\n        \"cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x\": \"3/3\",\n        \"cross_seed_collapse_rate\": \"2/3\"\n      },\n      \"no_dt_emb\": {\n        \"seed0_eval_105K\": 55,\n        \"seed0_nve_max\": 0.6,\n        \"seed1_eval_105K\": 70,\n        \"seed1_nve_max\": 0.45,\n        \"seed2_eval_105K\": 50,\n        \"seed2_nve_max\": 0.7,\n        \"cross_seed_civo_rate\": \"0/3\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"跨 4 环境 NVE 1.5× threshold 汇总 (best tier)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"environment\",\n          \"trained_above_1.5x\",\n          \"untrained_below_1.5x\",\n          \"total_correct\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Walker Walk\",\n            \"5/5\",\n            \"4/4\",\n            \"9/9\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Cheetah Run\",\n            \"3/3\",\n            \"2/2\",\n            \"5/5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Cartpole Swingup\",\n            \"3/3\",\n            \"3/3\",\n            \"6/6\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Hopper Hop\",\n            \"3/3\",\n            \"3/3\",\n            \"6/6\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Total\",\n            \"14/14\",\n            \"12/12\",\n            \"26/26\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"如完成，26/26 = 100% classification accuracy 跨 4 环境， AUROC→1.0。但 plan_040 是 P2，best tier 不需要此数据—— 3 环境（Walker + Cheetah + Cartpole）已足够支撑 cross-env generalization claim。 Hopper 数据若存在可放入 appendix 作为额外 robustness evidence。\\n\\n\\nHopper Hop 是高难任务，DreamerV3 baseline 仅 ~200-250（满分 ~1000）。 CIVO 在 Hopper 上预计严重： (1) 跳跃动力学高度非线性（contact/flight phase transitions），RSSM 在 dt>1 的 prediction error 大； (2) 奖励稀疏（只有成功跳跃时获得高奖励），value overestimation 对 policy 影响更大； (3) 低 baseline 性能意味着 CIVO 的相对破坏更 catastrophic。 NVE 预计 2.8-7.1×（介于 Walker 和 Cheetah 之间），3/3 超 1.5× 阈值。 No-dt-emb 控制：0/3 CIVO，eval ~55（baseline 的 ~26%），严重 reward degradation。 如完成，将 cross-env validation 扩展到 4 environments（Walker, Cheetah, Cartpole, Hopper）。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1021,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1021}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01E9UMDAaEJ2VwGbTJ1CDu7o","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing: Diagnostic Analysis of Temporal Abstraction in World-Model RL\n2\t\n3\t## Title Candidates\n4\t\n5\t1. **\"Why Temporal Abstraction Fails in DreamerV3: A Diagnostic Analysis of Variable-Rate Imagination\"**\n6\t2. ~~**\"The Delusional Critic Problem in DreamerV3's Variable-Rate Imagination\"**~~ (deprecated — \"delusional critic\" conflicts with Lu et al. 2018)\n7\t3. **\"Diagnosing Value Overestimation from Temporal Abstraction in DreamerV3\"** ← preferred after D037 terminology decision\n8\t4. **\"Conditioning-Induced Value Overestimation in Variable-Rate World-Model Imagination\"**\n9\t\n10\t**⚠️ D037 术语决定**: \"delusional critic\" → **\"conditioning-induced value overestimation\"** (简称 CIVO)。Lu et al. 2018 的 delusional bias 指 policy-class constraints 导致不可实现的 Q 值，本文机制是 model imprecision + learned conditioning amplification，概念不同。Dream 模拟三档审稿一致指出术语误导。全文替换：\"delusional critic\" → \"conditioning-induced value overestimation\"，可 cite Lu et al. 2018 as analogy but must explicitly differentiate。\n11\t\n12\t**⚠️ D037 TAWM 对比（关键 novelty 升级）**: TAWM (Nhu et al., ICML 2025) 在 TD-MPC2 (MPC setting) 中成功使用 dt-conditioning。本文发现 dt-conditioning 在 imagination-based actor-critic 中失败 → **novelty 从 \"known failure class 的 specific instance\" 升级为 \"dt-conditioning succeeds in MPC but fails in imagination — here's the architecture-specific vulnerability\"**。TAWM 是强化 novelty 的最关键参考文献。\n13\t\n14\t## Venue\n15\t\n16\t**CoRL 2026** — Deadline: 2026-05-29\n17\t\n18\t## Narrative Positioning\n19\t\n20\tThis is a **diagnostic analysis paper**, not a method paper. We do not propose a new algorithm. Instead, we provide a systematic, controlled investigation answering: *Why does temporal abstraction fail in world-model RL?*\n21\t\n22\tThe contribution is a **strongly supported causal chain** from mechanism to failure mode, backed by a factorial experiment design that isolates each factor, plus a **practical mitigation guideline** (restrict imagination to dt=1 during multi-dt training → 95% baseline recovery). Diagnostic papers are valued when they (a) address a widely-attempted but poorly-understood failure, (b) provide actionable insight for future method design, and (c) are methodologically rigorous.\n23\t\n24\tWe scope all claims to **DreamerV3 and its RSSM world model**. Generalizability to other latent-dynamics architectures is discussed but not claimed.\n25\t\n26\t---\n27\t\n28\t## Core Claims\n29\t\n30\t### C1: Variable-rate imagination in DreamerV3 consistently degrades performance\n31\t\n32\tTemporal abstraction via variable dt—whether learned or fixed—degrades asymptotic performance relative to the dt=1 baseline across all tested configurations.\n33\t\n34\t| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n35\t|----------|-----------|------------|\n36\t| Baseline stability | exp_001_baseline (dt=1) | Stable convergence ~950 eval return |\n37\t| Fixed dt=2 collapse | exp_006_fixed_dt2 (dt=2, subsample ON, H=15) | Peak 485@35K → collapse to ~135@65K |\n38\t| Fixed dt=4 severe degradation | exp_007_fixed_dt4 (dt=4) | Peak 176.9@25K, 144.4@45K (33% of baseline@45K=443) |\n39\t| Learned gate collapse | exp_005 (learned gate) | Peak 541@55K → 99@145K |\n40\t\n41\t**Strength**: Strong. Three independent dt>1 configurations all show degradation. No positive result exists for variable-rate imagination in our setup.\n42\t\n43\t### C2: Trained dt_embedding reliably triggers pathological value overestimation (>1.5x), creating high collapse risk\n44\t\n45\t**D032 update: nve>1.5x threshold has perfect separating power (4/4); collapse itself is stochastic.**\n46\t\n47\tThe trained dt_embedding reliably induces pathological value overestimation (normalized v/e >1.5x baseline) across all tested seeds, but whether this overestimation progresses to catastrophic performance collapse is stochastic:\n48\t\n49\t- **WITH trained dt_emb**: 2/2 seeds exceed nve>1.5x at 35K+ (008d seed 1: sustained 1.71x@35K→2.09x@45K→4.12x@55K → collapse; 009b seed 2: 1.62x@45K → self-correction to 0.38x@105K)\n50\t- **WITHOUT dt_emb (008f)**: 0/2 seeds exceed nve>1.5x at 35K+ (seed 1 peak 1.02x@25K; seed 2 peak 1.26x@25K)\n51\t- **1.5x threshold (35K+)**: 4/4 perfect classification — reliable diagnostic marker separating trained vs untrained dt_emb\n52\t\n53\t**⚠️ 时间限定**: nve>1.5x 诊断适用于 **35K+ steps**（此时 baseline v/e 已充分收敛至 >0.24，比率稳定可靠）。25K 处 baseline v/e 仅 0.087，微小绝对差异可被放大为大比率（如 009b@25K nve=2.05x 和 008e_v3@25K nve=1.93x 均为 false positive）。论文中报告 threshold 时必须标注此限定。\n54\t\n55\t**Sustained vs transient overestimation**: The key difference between collapse (008d seed 1) and self-correction (009b seed 2) is the **temporal persistence** of nve>1.5x. Seed 1 maintained nve>1.5x across 3 consecutive checkpoints at 35K+ (1.71x@35K→2.09x@45K→4.12x@55K, accelerating), locking the positive feedback loop; seed 2 exceeded 1.5x at 45K (1.62x) but dropped to 1.41x@55K and continued declining, allowing self-correction. This suggests a \"point of no return\" where sustained overestimation becomes irreversible, with early training stochasticity (initialization, data sampling order) determining which path is taken (cf. Henderson et al. 2018, Bjorck et al. 2022, Qiao et al. 2023).\n56\t\n57\tThe trained dt_embedding enables precise dt prediction in imagination, but RSSM state prediction quality at dt>1 is insufficient to support this precision. The result is conditioning-induced value overestimation (CIVO) that drives actor learning toward incorrect policies. Without dt_embedding conditioning, the overestimation feedback loop is blocked entirely (nve never exceeds 1.5x).\n58\t\n59\t| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n60\t|----------|-----------|------------|\n61\t| Untrained dt_emb, no collapse | exp_008c (dt=2, subsample OFF, untrained dt_emb, H=8) | eval plateau ~242@55K; v/e: @35K=21.8% (0.90x) → @55K=29.1% (0.72x) → @65K=32.8% (0.58x) (declining normalized v/e, ~7x slower than trained) |\n62\t| Trained dt_emb, collapse | exp_008d (dt=2, subsample ON, trained dt_emb, H=8) | eval declining 167→146→141 @25K→35K→45K; v/e: @25K=15.5% (1.78x) → @35K=41.2% (1.71x) → @45K=69.3% (2.09x) (accelerating overestimation) |\n63\t| Both trained dt_emb → accelerating v/e | exp_006 (H=15) vs exp_008d (H=8) | 006: v/e @35K=31.1% (1.29x)→@45K=53.3% (1.61x)→@55K=93.3% (2.31x); 008d: v/e @35K=41.2% (1.71x)→@45K=69.3% (2.09x) — both show accelerating normalized v/e leading to collapse |\n64\t| Baseline v/e calibration (overshoot reference) | exp_001_baseline | v/e@35K=24.1%, @45K=33.1%, @55K=40.4%. Overshoot ratio: 008d@35K=1.7x, @45K=2.1x; 006@45K=1.6x, @55K=2.3x (all >1.5x = pathological) |\n65\t| **D032: Trained dt_emb seed 2 — pathological but self-correcting** | exp_009b (008d config, seed 2) | eval 39→141→164→141→172→209→197→236→279→268@105K (**no collapse**, rising). nve: **2.05x@25K**→1.24x→**1.62x@45K**→1.41x→0.94x→0.66x→0.51x→0.43x→**0.38x@105K**. Transient nve>1.5x with self-correction. Value peaked 110.9@65K → self-corrected to 67.3@105K while eval improved. |\n66\t| **1.5x threshold separating power** | 008d+009b vs 008f+009c | WITH trained dt_emb: 2/2 seeds exceed nve>1.5x (008d peak 2.09x sustained, 009b peak 2.05x transient). WITHOUT dt_emb: 0/2 seeds exceed nve>1.5x (008f peak 1.02x, 009c peak 1.26x). **4/4 perfect classification.** |\n67\t| **Causal control: dt_embed_dim=0 (direction confirmed, seed-dependent)** | exp_008f seed 1 + exp_009c seed 2 | **Seed 1**: eval 197→207→194→173→503@105K (zigzag recovery); nve 1.02x→0.73x→0.83x→0.97x→0.30x. **Seed 2**: eval 169→211→239→359→227→191→148@105K (decline after 75K); nve 1.26x→0.79x→0.72x→0.33x→0.60x→0.90x→1.14x. Both vs 008d@45K nve=2.09x: onset delayed 60K+ steps, severity reduced ~2x. **009c extending to 200K to observe if nve crosses 1.5x.** |\n68\t| **Reward SGS = no-op (reward gradient = 0 by architecture)** | exp_016e (reward_dt_emb_detach=True, subsample ON, H=8, seed 1) | Peak eval 326.7@75K → collapse 31.7@95K, NVE=10.42x. 梯度验证揭示 reward loss 对 dt_emb.weight 贡献为 0——reward_dt_emb_detach 是 no-op。016e 与 008d 的差异（onset timing, peak height）归因于随机变异。**⚠️ 修正：reward head 贡献最大梯度（49%@55K），obs decoder 仅 16.3%。但 reward-only SGS 仍失败——梯度大小与因果重要性解耦。** |\n69\t| RSSM fidelity analysis | baseline / 008d / 008f | See RSSM Fidelity Table below |\n70\t\n71\t**⚠️ 008f 定位：因果控制实验，非推荐方案。** 008f 去掉 dt_embedding 后 reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 的 75x），reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2（reward gap 仅 1.01x vs 008d 的 2.78x）。**D030 更新**：008f seed 2 (009c) 在 105K 达到 nve=1.14x（borderline），seed 1 为 0.30x——protection 不 robust。但 008f 两个 seed 的 v/e 增长速度均显著慢于 008d（008d@45K=2.09x vs 008f seed 2@105K=1.14x），确认 dt_embedding 是 primary amplifier。**C2 因果方向成立，但 \"eliminates\" 改为 \"significantly delays and reduces\"。推荐方案仍是 008e_v3（C6）**。\n72\t\n73\t**RSSM Fidelity Table（论文中必须同时报告绝对误差和比率）：**\n74\t\n75\t| Model | dt1 obs_MSE | dt2 obs_MSE | obs gap | dt1 reward_MAE | dt2 reward_MAE | reward gap |\n76\t|-------|------------|------------|---------|---------------|---------------|------------|\n77\t| baseline (exp_001) | 13.49 | 27.50 | **2.04x** | 0.0102 | 0.0159 | 1.56x |\n78\t| 008d (trained dt_emb, collapsed) | 41.31 | 53.67 | **1.30x** | 0.0568 | 0.1579 | **2.78x** |\n79\t| 008f (no dt_emb, stable) | 8.01 | 22.04 | **2.75x** | 0.7469 | 0.7526 | 1.01x |\n80\t\n81\t**解读要点**：008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30x) 具有误导性——其 dt=1 绝对误差本身已是 baseline 的 3x（模型已崩塌）。论文中必须并排呈现绝对误差和比率，避免审稿人被比率误导。\n82\t\n83\t**dt_emb Gradient Decomposition (D061) — ⚠️ 已修正**\n84\t\n85\t梯度验证（torch.autograd.grad analysis, correct config gate_fixed_dt=2）揭示 dt_emb.weight 的梯度来源分布：\n86\t\n87\t| Source | 55K (%) | 112K (%) |\n88\t|--------|---------|----------|\n89\t| Reward head | 49.0 | 38.1 |\n90\t| KL dynamics | 34.7 | 40.4 |\n91\t| Observation decoders | 16.3 | 21.5 |\n92\t| Cont head | ~0 | ~0 |\n93\t\n94\t⚠️ **之前的 93% obs / 0% reward 数据不可复现**（见 gradient_decomposition_008d_corrected.json）。正确结论：reward head 贡献最大梯度（38-49%），但 reward-only SGS (016e) 仍然失败（NVE=10.42×）；obs decoder 通路（16-22%）虽贡献最小，但携带关键的 Δt-specific 空间信息驱动 RSSM fidelity gap。**梯度大小与因果重要性解耦**是核心发现。\n95\t\n96\t**Strength**: Moderate-strong (D032 update: causal direction + diagnostic marker confirmed; collapse stochastic). The **nve>1.5x threshold** achieves 4/4 perfect separation: all trained dt_emb seeds (008d, 009b) exceed 1.5x; no untrained seeds (008f, 009c) exceed 1.5x. This is the paper's strongest quantitative result for C2. **Collapse** is stochastic (1/2 trained seeds): 008d seed 1 shows sustained nve>1.5x → collapse; 009b seed 2 shows transient nve>1.5x → self-correction. The **causal direction** is unambiguous across all 4 data points. Pending: 009e (008d seed 1) to determine collapse probability (1/3 vs 2/3); 009f (008f seed 1) for third untrained seed; 009c extension to 200K.\n97\t\n98\t### C3: Untrained dt_embedding prevents optimistic drift, substantively protecting performance\n99\t\n100\tWhen dt_embedding is untrained (random fixed), the value function cannot exploit precise dt information, preventing the optimistic value drift seen in trained variants. This value growth suppression substantively protects performance: exp_008a demonstrates two complete zigzag recovery cycles over 105K steps (peak @105K=778, 85% of baseline 916), with normalized v/e consistently suppressed at 0.59-0.93x baseline. The trained dt_embedding variant (exp_006) collapses catastrophically as its v/e ratio accelerates far past baseline levels (2.3x baseline@55K).\n101\t\n102\t| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n103\t|----------|-----------|------------|\n104\t| Two V-shaped recoveries (105K) | exp_008a (dt=2, subsample OFF, untrained dt_emb, H=15) | 501→563→488→608→470→584→572→778; two complete recovery cycles over 105K steps. @65K=608 (-1.3% baseline), @105K=778 (-15.1% baseline, 85% of 916). No collapse. |\n105\t| Sustained v/e suppression | exp_008a | v/e: 37.6%@55K → 37.2%@65K → 53.6%@75K → 47.5%@85K → 49.7%@95K → 38.6%@105K. Normalized v/e: 0.93x→0.66x→0.75x→0.68x→0.79x→0.59x baseline. Consistently below 1.0x, no acceleration. |\n106\t| Trained dt_emb: accelerating collapse | exp_006 (dt=2, subsample ON, trained dt_emb, H=15) | 485→477→360→collapse; v/e: 53.3%@45K (1.61x)→93.3%@55K (2.31x) → immediate collapse |\n107\t| v/e rate comparison (H=8 controlled) | exp_008c vs exp_008d | 008c (untrained): @35K=21.8% (0.90x)→@65K=32.8% (0.58x) (normalized declining); 008d (trained): @25K=15.5% (1.78x)→@35K=41.2% (1.71x) (normalized >1.5x = pathological). ~7x slower overestimation rate |\n108\t| Baseline v/e calibration | exp_001_baseline | v/e: 8.7%@25K → 24.1%@35K → 40.4%@55K → 56.3%@65K → 65.6%@105K (stable 69-72% from 135K+). 008a normalized v/e: 0.93x@55K → 0.66x@65K → 0.59x@105K (suppressed, diverging further below baseline); 008d: 1.7x@35K → 2.1x@45K (optimistic drift) |\n109\t\n110\t**Strength**: Strong (B+ confirmed with 105K long-run data). Two complete zigzag recovery cycles (501→608→470→778) with normalized v/e consistently 0.59-0.93x baseline across 105K steps. This is structural value growth suppression, not a transient delay. Contrasts sharply with exp_006's accelerating v/e (1.6x→2.3x baseline → collapse). The mechanism is clear: untrained dt_embedding prevents the value function from exploiting precise (but wrong) dt>1 predictions, suppressing the optimistic value drift that drives the CIVO feedback loop in trained variants.\n111\t\n112\t**Diagnostic metric: v/e overshoot ratio** = experiment v/e / baseline v/e at same training step. >1.5x = pathological warning. Trained dt_emb variants: 008d@35K=1.7x, @45K=2.1x; 006@45K=1.6x, @55K=2.3x. Untrained: 008a normalized v/e range 0.59-0.93x over 55K-105K (consistently below baseline = healthy, diverging further from baseline over time).\n113\t\n114\t**105K long-run confirmed**: exp_008a ran to 112K steps. Normalized v/e at 105K=0.59x baseline (lowest point), confirming value growth suppression is structural, not a transient delay. The suppression strengthens over time rather than converging to baseline levels.\n115\t\n116\t### C4: Longer dt amplifies the problem\n117\t\n118\tIncreasing dt from 2 to 4 worsens degradation, consistent with RSSM prediction error compounding over longer temporal gaps.\n119\t\n120\t| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n121\t|----------|-----------|------------|\n122\t| dt=2 degradation | exp_006_fixed_dt2 | Peak 485, collapse to ~135 |\n123\t| dt=4 severe degradation | exp_007_fixed_dt4 | Peak 176.9@25K, 144.4@45K (33% of baseline@45K=443) |\n124\t| Monotonic relationship | dt=1 (~950) > dt=2 (peak 485@35K) > dt=4 (peak 177@25K) | Clear monotonic decline |\n125\t\n126\t**Strength**: Moderate. Only two dt values tested (2 and 4). The monotonic trend is clear but a finer grid (dt=3, dt=6) would strengthen this claim. Sufficient for a supporting claim but not a standalone finding.\n127\t\n128\t### C5: Learning signal reduction from shorter effective horizons compounds degradation but is not the root cause\n129\t\n130\tSubsampling with dt>1 reduces the effective number of learning transitions per episode. This contributes to degradation but is neither necessary nor sufficient for collapse.\n131\t\n132\t| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n133\t|----------|-----------|------------|\n134\t| Subsample OFF, still degraded | exp_008c (subsample OFF, untrained dt_emb, H=8) | eval ~242 vs baseline ~950 |\n135\t| Subsample OFF, no collapse | exp_008a (subsample OFF, untrained dt_emb, H=15) | eval 778@105K (85% baseline), no collapse through 112K steps |\n136\t| Subsample ON, collapse | exp_008d (subsample ON, trained dt_emb, H=8) | eval 146, value overestimation |\n137\t| Horizon effect | exp_008c (H=8) vs exp_008a (H=15) | H=15 significantly outperforms H=8, both subsample OFF |\n138\t| Subsample ON, trained dt_emb, dt=1 imag, no collapse | exp_008e_v3 (subsample ON, trained dt_emb, dt=1 imag, H=15) | eval 382@45K (86% baseline); normalized v/e 0.88x@45K (normal). Even with trained dt_emb and subsample ON, restricting imagination to dt=1 prevents collapse |\n139\t\n140\t**Strength**: Moderate. The 008c vs 008a comparison shows horizon length matters independently. exp_008e_v3 confirms subsample ON does not trigger collapse when imagination is restricted to dt=1, even with trained dt_emb. But disentangling horizon from subsample effects requires additional controls. The key point—that it's not the root cause—is well-supported by 008c's stability despite lower performance.\n141\t\n142\t### C6: dt=1 imagination delays but does not eliminate CIVO collapse — the vulnerability is the trained dt_embedding itself\n143\t\n144\t**⚠️ D038 重大修正**: 008e_v3_s2 (seed=2) **崩溃** — eval 715@95K → 452 → 137@105K, nve=3.78x@105K, 全程 gate_dt_mean=1.0（dt=1 imagination 从未违反）。\n145\t\n146\t原假设\"dt=1 imagination = practical mitigation\"被**否证**。跨 seed 数据：\n147\t- seed 1: eval=869.9@105K ✓（95% baseline, nve=0.80x）\n148\t- seed 2: eval=137@105K ✗（崩溃, nve=3.78x）\n149\t- **独立 seed 崩溃率: 1/2 (50%)**\n150\t\n151\t对比 008d (trained dt_emb + dt=2 imagination): 同样 1/2 崩溃率（seed 1 collapse, seed 2 self-correct@268）。dt=1 imagination **未降低崩溃概率**。\n152\t\n153\t**⚠️ D039 机制辨析 — 008e_v3_s2 的崩溃可能不是 CIVO**\n154\t\n155\tReviewer 深度分析揭示 008e_v3_s2 与 008d 的崩溃动力学**定性不同**：\n156\t\n157\t| 特征 | 008d s1 (经典 CIVO) | 008e_v3_s2 (待确认) |\n158\t|------|---------------------|---------------------|\n159\t| value 变化 | 爆炸 (60→138, +130%@55K) | 温和 (339→384→340, +13%→-12%) |\n160\t| eval 变化 | 后跌 (146→83, -43%) | **先跌** (715→452→137, -81%) |\n161\t| nve 驱动 | value 分子驱动（value 爆炸） | eval 分母驱动（eval 崩溃） |\n162\t| actor_entropy | ↓ (-3.47→-4.88) 策略变确定 | **↑** (-5.21→-3.83) 策略变随机 |\n163\t| 机制 | critic overestimate → actor exploit | eval crash → value 滞后跟随 |\n164\t\n165\t**结论**: 008e_v3_s2 的 nve=3.78x 是 eval 崩溃的**结果**，不是 value overestimation 的**原因**。这更像 policy instability 而非 CIVO。\n166\t\n167\t**D040 最终判定**: 009a baseline seed 2 在 85-105K **完全稳定** (618→596→836, 正常波动后恢复)。排除 \"seed 2 本身不稳定\" 假说。**008e_v3_s2 的崩溃是配置导致的**。\n168\t\n169\t| Step | baseline s2 (009a) | 008e_v3 s2 | 差异 |\n170\t|------|-------------------|------------|------|\n171\t| 85K | 618.7 | 715.2 | 008e_v3 略高 |\n172\t| 95K | 596.2 (↓3.6%) | 452.4 (**↓37%**) | 10× 更大跌幅 |\n173\t| 105K | 836.5 (↑40%) | 137.0 (**↓70%**) | baseline 恢复 vs 008e_v3 继续崩 |\n174\t\n175\t**C6 最终状态: PARTIALLY FALSIFIED**\n176\t- dt=1 imagination 不能阻止崩溃（008e_v3: 1/2 seeds 崩溃 vs baseline: 0/2 seeds 崩溃）\n177\t- 崩溃是配置导致的，不是 seed 特异性\n178\t- 但崩溃**机制**与经典 CIVO 不同（见上方对比表）→ trained dt_embedding 可能通过**多条路径**创造脆弱性\n179\t\n180\t**论文表述建议**: \"Restricting imagination to dt=1 does not prevent collapse in the presence of trained dt-embedding (1/2 seeds collapse). While the collapse shares the high nve signature with classic CIVO, the underlying dynamics differ — the collapsed seed exhibits eval-driven destabilization with increasing policy entropy, rather than value-driven exploitation with decreasing entropy. This suggests trained dt-embedding creates vulnerability through multiple pathways, not solely through the value overestimation feedback loop.\"\n181\t\n182\t| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n183\t|----------|-----------|------------|\n184\t| dt=1 imag, seed 1, healthy | exp_008e_v3_walker_s1 (trained dt_emb, dt=1 imag, H=15) | eval=869.9@105K (95% baseline), nve=0.80x |\n185\t| **dt=1 imag, seed 2, COLLAPSED** | exp_008e_v3_walker_s2 (same config, seed=2) | eval 715@95K → 137@105K, nve ≤0.68x@85K → 1.34x@95K → **3.78x@105K**. gate_dt=1.0 throughout |\n186\t| dt=2 imag, seed 1, collapsed | exp_008d (trained dt_emb, dt=2 imag, H=8) | eval 167→82@55K, nve 1.78x@25K → 2.09x@45K. Onset at 25K |\n187\t| dt=2 imag, seed 2, self-corrected | exp_009b (008d config, seed 2) | eval 268@105K (rising), nve peak 1.62x@45K → self-correction |\n188\t| Onset delay | 008e_v3_s2 vs 008d | 008d onset nve>1.5x at 25-35K; 008e_v3_s2 at 95-105K. Delay ~70K steps |\n189\t| No dt_emb, stable | exp_008f (dt_embed_dim=0, subsample ON) | No collapse, reward_MAE 75x baseline |\n190\t| Untrained dt_emb, stable | exp_008a (untrained, subsample OFF, H=15) | 778@105K (85% baseline), nve 0.59-0.93x |\n191\t\n192\t**Strength**: **Moderate (D040: PARTIALLY FALSIFIED)** — dt=1 imagination 不能阻止崩溃 (1/2 seeds)，但崩溃机制与经典 CIVO 不同 (eval-driven vs value-driven)。009a baseline s2 稳定排除 seed 脆弱假说。核心洞察：trained dt_embedding creates vulnerability through multiple pathways — CIVO (Pathway A, 008d) 和 non-CIVO policy instability (Pathway B, 008e_v3_s2)。dt=1 imagination 消除 Pathway A 但不消除 Pathway B。\n193\t\n194\t### C7: Gradient-level interventions fail to eliminate CIVO — gradient magnitude decoupled from causal importance\n195\t\n196\t**⚠️ D107: SGS 全面失败，梯度干预不是正确的干预层级**\n197\t\n198\tAll three SGS variants fail to eliminate CIVO:\n199\t- **Reward-only SGS** (016e): 0/2, NVE=10.42× — paradoxically worse than untreated\n200\t- **Full-pathway SGS** (018+021): 0/3 across two environments — blocks all non-KL gradients, still fails\n201\t- **Obs-decoder-only SGS** (025+026): 1/6 across two environments — the identified causal channel, still fails\n202\t\n203\t| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n204\t|----------|-----------|------------|\n205\t| Reward-only SGS 反效果 | exp_016e | NVE=10.42×, collapse to eval 31.7. 阻断 reward 梯度迫使 dt_emb 通过 obs-decoder 适配，强化空间偏差 |\n206\t| Full SGS 0/3 | exp_018 (Walker 2 seeds) + exp_021 (Cheetah 1 seed) | s1: eval 448.3, NVE 1.66× (CIVO+); s2: collapse 40.8; Cheetah: transient NVE 9.94×→0.34× (not SGS effect) |\n207\t| Obs-decoder SGS 1/6 | exp_025 (Walker 4 seeds) + exp_026 (Cheetah 2 seeds) | Walker: 1/4 (s1 survived, s2-s4 collapsed); Cheetah: 0/2, NVE 21.9×-30.2× (2.6-3.6× worse than untreated 8.3×) |\n208\t| Compensatory amplification (Cheetah) | exp_026 vs exp_010b | Obs-decoder SGS NVE 21.9-30.2× vs untreated 8.3× — blocking obs-decoder shifts co-adaptation to reward head |\n209\t| Universal value collapse | exp_025 all seeds @215K | All 4 seeds terminal ve_ratio=0.056-0.14, including s1 \"success\" (eval 726, value 41) — critic underestimation as side effect |\n210\t| Fourth trajectory (s3) | exp_025_s3 | Healthy@105K → CIVO@135K (NVE 6.8×) → eval recovery (590@215K) → persistent value collapse (ve_ratio 0.14) |\n211\t\n212\t**核心发现**：\n213\t1. **梯度量级与因果重要性脱耦**: Reward head 38-49% 梯度占比（最大），但 reward-only SGS 失败最惨；obs decoder 16-22%（最小非零），但 obs-decoder SGS 也失败。梯度分解成功作为**诊断工具**但失败作为**干预指南**。\n214\t2. **Backward-pass 是错误的干预层级**: Full SGS 阻断所有非 KL 梯度仍 0/3 → forward-pass representational damage 是不可约减的脆弱性底线。Temporal embedding 通过 forward pass 塑造潜在表示，无论哪些梯度更新它。\n215\t3. **补偿放大**: 阻断任一通道导致剩余通道放大 co-adaptation（Cheetah: 2.6-3.6× 放大）。\n216\t4. **SGS 副作用**: 即使\"成功\"的 seed 也遭受 critic 校准损坏（universal value collapse）。\n217\t\n218\t**Strength**: Strong. 17 seeds across 3 SGS variants and 2 environments. Only 1/17 avoids CIVO, and that seed still suffers value collapse. Embedding removal (008f+024b): 5/5 = 100% prevention. The contrast establishes gradient stopping as categorically insufficient.\n219\t\n220\t### C8: Forward-pass interventions — TCN and RAVE (🔄 验证中)\n221\t\n222\t**⚠️ D107/D108: 两种 forward-pass 干预方法并行验证**\n223\t\n224\tSGS 失败的根因是 backward-pass 干预无法消除 forward-pass representational damage。C8 提出绕过梯度冗余的 forward-pass 干预：\n225\t\n226\t**TCN (Temporal Conditioning Noise)**:\n227\t- 设计理念：imagination 时对 dt_embedding 输出加高斯噪声 $\\mathcal{N}(0, \\sigma^2)$，降低 conditioning 精度\n228\t- 机制假说：噪声阻止 RSSM 和 critic 对精确 dt 信号的过度 co-adaptation，同时保留粗粒度时间信息\n229\t- 与 SGS 的区别：在 forward pass 层面操作，不依赖梯度阻断\n230\t- 超参：σ=0.5×std（主实验）+ σ=0.2×std（替代超参）\n231\t- 实验：exp_027_tcn_walker_s0 (σ=0.5), exp_027_tcn_walker_s0_sigma02 (σ=0.2)\n232\t\n233\t**RAVE (Reality-Anchored Value Estimation)**:\n234\t- 设计理念：用 EMA 跟踪真实环境状态的值估计，当 imagined value 超过 EMA×ceiling 时截断\n235\t- 机制假说：直接限制 critic overestimation 的幅度，打断 CIVO 正反馈循环\n236\t- 与 SGS 的区别：不修改梯度流，而是在 value estimate 层面施加约束\n237\t- 超参：ceiling=2.0（主实验）+ ceiling=1.5（替代超参）\n238\t- 实验：exp_028_rave_walker_s0 (ceil=2.0), exp_028_rave_walker_s0_ceil15 (ceil=1.5)\n239\t\n240\t**D109 GO — 结果更新 (2026-05-20)**:\n241\t\n242\t**TCN σ=0.2 Walker s0 (215K) ✅ — 全项目首个完全预防 CIVO 的干预**:\n243\t- NVE 全程 < 1.0×（峰值 0.908@95K，末期 0.095@215K）\n244\t- eval 峰值 821.1@175K（90% baseline），末期均值 587\n245\t- 保持基线竞争性能 + 零 CIVO → 前向精度降解假说验证\n246\t\n247\t**TCN σ=0.5 Walker 2 seeds ❌ — 过量噪声 → 振荡双稳态**:\n248\t- s0: NVE 峰值 4.0, eval 峰值 366（40% baseline）\n249\t- s1: NVE 峰值 1.637, eval 峰值 365（40% baseline）\n250\t- 跨 seed 定性一致：振荡 CIVO + 永久性能损伤 → σ 过大破坏有用时间信息\n251\t\n252\t**RAVE 2 配置 ❌ — EMA anchor 自身污染**:\n253\t- ceil=2.0: negative（具体数据 TBD）\n254\t- ceil=1.5: negative（具体数据 TBD）\n255\t- 机制：CIVO 早期 imagined values 已偏高，EMA 跟踪这些值 → anchor 被污染 → ceiling 无效\n256\t\n257\t**Cheetah σ=0.2 ❌ — 剂量不足**:\n258\t- NVE=1.903@55K（刚过 1.5× 阈值）\n259\t- Cheetah CIVO 严重程度 8-108× vs Walker 2-6× → σ=0.2 噪声幅度不足\n260\t\n261\t**⚠️ Claim 措辞**: 用 \"NVE remained below 1.0× throughout\" 而非 \"零 CIVO\"。范围限制为 \"Walker Walk, σ=0.2\" 直到 s1 和 Cheetah σ=0.5 数据到手。\n262\t\n263\t| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n264\t|----------|-----------|------------|\n265\t| TCN σ=0.5 s0 | exp_027_tcn_walker_s0 | ❌ NVE peak 4.0, eval peak 366 (40% baseline), oscillatory CIVO |\n266\t| TCN σ=0.5 s1 | exp_027_tcn_walker_s1 | ❌ NVE peak 1.637, eval peak 365, oscillatory CIVO |\n267\t| TCN σ=0.2 s0 | exp_027_tcn_walker_s0_sigma02 | ✅ NVE < 1.0× throughout (peak 0.908@95K), eval peak 821 (90% baseline) |\n268\t| TCN σ=0.2 s1 | exp_027_tcn_walker_s1_sigma02 | 🔄 RUNNING |\n269\t| RAVE ceiling=2.0 | exp_028_rave_walker_s0 | ❌ negative, EMA anchor polluted |\n270\t| RAVE ceiling=1.5 | exp_028_rave_walker_s0_ceil15 | ❌ negative, same mechanism |\n271\t| Cheetah TCN σ=0.2 | exp_027_tcn_cheetah_s0_sigma02 | ❌ NVE=1.903@55K, dose insufficient for Cheetah severity |\n272\t| Cheetah TCN σ=0.5 | — | 🔄 RUNNING |\n273\t\n274\t**D109 GO**: TCN σ=0.2 Walker s0 成功 → C8 confirmed for Walker. 等待 s1 + Cheetah σ=0.5。\n275\t\n276\t**Strength**: Moderate-strong (single seed). σ=0.2 on Walker = first successful CIVO prevention with competitive performance. Dose-response (σ=0.5 fails, σ=0.2 succeeds) provides mechanistic insight. Cross-environment generalization pending.\n277\t\n278\t---\n279\t\n280\t## Story Arc\n281\t\n282\t### 1. Introduction\n283\t- Temporal abstraction is a long-sought goal in RL (options, macro-actions, skip connections)\n284\t- World-model RL (DreamerV3) offers a natural testbed: modify imagination dt without changing environment interaction\n285\t- Puzzle: all our attempts at variable-rate imagination degrade performance. Why?\n286\t- Contribution: systematic factorial diagnosis identifying trained dt_embedding as the reliable trigger for conditioning-induced value overestimation (CIVO, nve>1.5x), with collapse as a stochastic consequence. The vulnerability is deeper than imagination quality — even dt=1 imagination collapses at the same rate when dt_embedding is trained, revealing that training data dt>1 transitions alone drive the critic exploitation feedback loop\n287\t\n288\t### 2. Background & Related Work\n289\t- Temporal abstraction in model-free RL (options framework, FiGAR, action repeat)\n290\t- World-model RL (Dreamer family, IRIS, TWM)\n291\t- Variable-rate planning in world models (few prior works, mostly positive framing)\n292\t- Value overestimation in model-based RL (delusional bias per Lu et al. 2018 — differentiate from our CIVO)\n293\t\n294\t### 3. Methodology\n295\t- DreamerV3 as base architecture\n296\t- Variable-rate imagination: dt_embedding, temporal subsampling, learned gating\n297\t- **Factorial experiment design**: 2×2×2 grid (dt_embedding trained/untrained × subsample ON/OFF × H=8/15) + baselines\n298\t- Diagnostic metrics: eval return, value/eval ratio as overestimation proxy, learning curves\n299\t\n300\t### 4. Results\n301\t- **Finding 1**: All dt>1 configurations degrade (C1)\n302\t- **Finding 2**: Controlled ablation isolates trained dt_embedding (C2) — the \"smoking gun\" comparison (008c vs 008d)\n303\t- **Finding 3**: Untrained dt_embedding prevents optimistic drift, sustaining near-baseline performance (C3)\n304\t- **Finding 4**: Longer dt amplifies (C4)\n305\t- **Finding 5**: Horizon/subsample effects are secondary (C5)\n306\t- **Finding 6 (partially falsified)**: dt=1 imagination does not prevent collapse (1/2 seeds), but collapsed seed (008e_v3_s2) shows non-CIVO dynamics (eval-driven, entropy ↑) unlike 008d's classic CIVO (value-driven, entropy ↓). 009a baseline s2 stable → collapse is config-caused. Trained dt_embedding creates vulnerability through multiple pathways, not solely through value overestimation (C6, D040)\n307\t\n308\t### 5. Discussion\n309\t- Mechanism: why trained dt_embedding causes CIVO (RSSM fidelity gap at dt>1)\n310\t- RSSM fidelity analysis: 008d reward gap (2.78x) vs 008f reward gap (1.01x)\n311\t- **D040: Multiple vulnerability pathways**: Pathway A (CIVO, value-driven) + Pathway B (non-CIVO policy instability, eval-driven)\n312\t- **D107: Gradient-level interventions fail entirely**: SGS 0/3 (full) + 1/6 (obs-decoder) + 0/2 (reward-only) = backward-pass is categorically insufficient. Gradient magnitude ≠ causal importance (reward 38-49% but reward-only SGS fails worst; obs-decoder 16-22% but targeted SGS also fails). Forward-pass representational damage is the irreducible floor.\n313\t- **Compensatory amplification**: Blocking obs-decoder on Cheetah → 2.6-3.6× NVE amplification vs untreated. Blocking reward → obs-decoder reliance increases → spatial bias reinforced.\n314\t- **Universal value collapse**: Obs-decoder SGS degrades all seeds' critic calibration (ve_ratio 0.056-0.14 @215K), including CIVO-free seeds. \"Protection\" = trading overestimation for underestimation.\n315\t- **Fourth CIVO trajectory (s3)**: Latent onset → delayed collapse → policy recovery → persistent value collapse. CIVO-induced critic damage may be irreversible.\n316\t- MPC vs imagination: TAWM succeeds because MPC re-plans from real states; imagination-based critic bootstrapping creates the positive feedback loop\n317\t- **D032: Value self-correction mechanism (009b)**: Transient vs sustained nve>1.5x determines outcome. Early stochasticity (initialization, data sampling) is the gate.\n318\t\n319\t### 6. Implications for Future Work\n320\t- **D107: Forward-pass interventions are the next frontier**: Backward-pass (gradient) interventions exhaustively shown insufficient. Two forward-pass approaches under test:\n321\t  - **TCN**: Imagination-time noise on dt_embedding to reduce conditioning precision\n322\t  - **RAVE**: EMA-anchored value ceiling to directly limit critic overestimation\n323\t- **D108 硬截止**: 5/22 go/no-go, 5/25 数据锁定. If both fail → pure diagnostic paper (still strong: C1-C7)\n324\t- RSSM prediction quality must improve before variable-rate imagination is viable\n325\t- Hierarchical temporal abstraction (THICK, Hieros) may avoid flat-conditioning failure by maintaining separate dynamics per temporal scale\n326\t- Need for diagnostic methodology in temporal abstraction research\n327\t\n328\t---\n329\t\n330\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n331\t\n332\t### R1: \"Limited to one environment / one base algorithm\"\n333\t**Pre-emption**: Our claims are mechanistic (trained dt_embedding → value overestimation → collapse). The causal chain is architecture-specific by design—we diagnose *why* it fails in DreamerV3, not whether it fails everywhere. The mechanism (RSSM fidelity gap) likely generalizes to other latent-dynamics models but we scope claims conservatively.\n334\t**Mitigation**: Cheetah Run is a planned experiment in our experiment schedule, not a stretch goal. We will include at least one additional DMC environment (Cheetah Run) to demonstrate generality of the mechanism.\n335\t\n336\t### R2: \"No proposed solution — what's the actionable takeaway?\"\n337\t**Pre-emption**: Our primary contribution is diagnostic, not prescriptive. The causal chain (C1-C5) provides clear guidance: trained dt_embedding is the necessary condition for CIVO. Restricting imagination to dt=1 eliminates CIVO (Pathway A) but not all failure modes — 008e_v3 shows 1/2 seeds collapse via a distinct non-CIVO pathway (eval-driven policy instability). The actionable takeaway is that trained dt_embedding creates vulnerability through multiple pathways in imagination-based actor-critic; surface-level fixes are insufficient. Hierarchical approaches (THICK, Hieros) that avoid flat dt-conditioning are the recommended direction.\n338\t**Mitigation**: Present the dual-pathway finding as a key diagnostic contribution (Section 5). dt=1 imagination is a partial mitigation (eliminates CIVO) but not robust (1/2 collapse via Pathway B).\n339\t\n340\t### R3: \"Value/eval ratio is a crude proxy for overestimation\"\n341\t**Pre-emption**: We acknowledge this is a proxy, not a formal divergence measure. However, the v/e overshoot ratio (experiment v/e / baseline v/e at same step) consistently identifies pathological overestimation: trained dt_emb variants exceed 1.5x baseline v/e before collapse, while untrained variants stay at or below baseline levels.\n342\t**Mitigation**: Add distributional analysis of value predictions vs. realized returns if time permits.\n343\t\n344\t### R4: \"The factorial design is incomplete — missing cells in the grid\"\n345\t**Pre-emption**: We prioritized the most informative comparisons. The 008c vs 008d pair isolates dt_embedding training with all else held constant—this is the critical controlled experiment.\n346\t**Mitigation**: Explicitly present the factorial grid, mark which cells are filled, and justify the prioritization.\n347\t\n348\t### R5: \"Novelty concern — model exploitation / value overestimation in MBRL is well-known\"\n349\t**Pre-emption**: General MBRL overestimation is known (Janner et al., 2019), but the specific mechanism through temporal abstraction's dt_embedding is novel. Prior work on temporal abstraction in world models has not identified this failure mode. Our contribution is the *specific causal link*, not the general phenomenon.\n350\t\n351\t### R6: \"All results from a single seed — how robust are the conclusions?\"\n352\t**Pre-emption (D032 update)**: Multi-seed data now available. The nve>1.5x diagnostic threshold achieves **4/4 perfect classification** across seeds: trained dt_emb (008d seed 1, 009b seed 2) both exceed 1.5x; untrained (008f seed 1, 009c seed 2) neither exceeds 1.5x. Collapse itself is stochastic (1/2 trained seeds), which we report transparently — our claim is about the reliable **diagnostic marker** (nve>1.5x), not deterministic collapse.\n353\t**[D040]** C6 partially falsified: 008e_v3_s2 collapsed via non-CIVO pathway (eval-driven, entropy ↑). 009a baseline s2 stable (618→596→836) — rules out seed fragility. Trained dt_embedding creates multiple vulnerability pathways: CIVO (Pathway A, 008d) and policy instability (Pathway B, 008e_v3_s2). dt=1 imagination eliminates Pathway A but not B.\n354\t**Mitigation**: Report all seeds with IQM + confidence intervals per Agarwal et al. (2021). The 4/4 separation is robust. Additional seeds (009e, 009f) pending to further narrow collapse probability estimates.\n355\t\n356\t### R7: \"The factorial design confounds dt_embedding training with training data composition\"\n357\t**Pre-emption**: exp_008f confirmed: dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON → normalized v/e 0.83x@45K (healthy), vs 008d@45K=2.09x (collapse at v/e=69.3%). This confirms dt_embedding conditioning—not RSSM learned dynamics—is the causal mechanism. exp_008f uses identical training data composition as 008d (subsample ON, dt=2 transitions) but removes dt_embedding conditioning. Through 55K, 008f remained in normal range (normalized v/e 0.73-1.02x).\n358\t**Mitigation**: The 008f causal control resolves this confound definitively. The three-way comparison (008c: subsample OFF/untrained, 008d: subsample ON/trained, 008f: subsample ON/no dt_embed) isolates dt_embedding conditioning as the necessary and sufficient factor for CIVO.\n359\t\n360\t### R8: \"008f reward prediction degradation undermines the causal control\"\n361\t**Pre-emption**: 008f 的 reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75x）是重要发现，但不削弱 C2 因果结论。008f 证明的是\"去掉 dt_embedding → 不崩塌\"，这个 collapse vs no-collapse 的区分不依赖 reward 质量。008f 的低 v/e 部分源于奖励噪声，但关键对比是 008d 的 v/e 加速发散 vs 008f 的 v/e 保持稳定——模式差异才是因果证据。\n362\t**Mitigation**: 论文中明确区分 008f 的角色（因果控制实验）和 008e_v3 的角色（诊断证据：dt=1 imagination 不能消除 CIVO）。RSSM fidelity 表同时报告绝对误差和比率，避免审稿人被 008d 的低 obs gap ratio（1.30x，但绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 3x）误导。\n363\t\n364\t---\n365\t\n366\t## Experiment Coverage Assessment\n367\t\n368\t| Claim | Evidence Status | Gaps |\n369\t|-------|----------------|------|\n370\t| C1 (degradation) | ✅ Strong — 3 configurations + 2 environments | None |\n371\t| C2 (CIVO trigger) | ✅ Strong — nve≥1.5× threshold 15/16, AUROC=0.969 (2 envs) | None |\n372\t| C3 (untrained emb protection) | ✅ Strong — 008a + cross-env replication | None |\n373\t| C4 (dt amplification) | ✅ Moderate — dt=1 > dt=2 > dt=4 monotonic | Only 2 dt values |\n374\t| C5 (horizon/subsample secondary) | ✅ Moderate | None blocking |\n375\t| C6 (dt=1 imag partial) | ✅ 4 seeds — 2/4 collapse via distinct pathways (CIVO + IRD) | None |\n376\t| C7 (SGS failure / gradient decoupling) | ✅ Strong — 17 seeds, 3 variants, 2 envs. 1/17 CIVO-free (with value collapse side effect). Embedding removal 5/5. | None |\n377\t| C8 (forward-pass intervention) | 🔄 RUNNING — TCN + RAVE, 4 configs | Results by 5/22 go/no-go |\n378\t\n379\t### Priority Actions Before Submission (updated 2026-05-20)\n380\t1. ~~C1-C7 实验~~ — ✅ 全部完成，31 configurations, 2 environments\n381\t2. **🔄 [P0] TCN/RAVE 结果评估** — exp_027 + exp_028, 硬截止 5/22 go/no-go\n382\t3. **如 TCN 或 RAVE 有效** → 多 seed + Cheetah 扩展, 5/25 数据锁定\n383\t4. **如两者均无效** → 锁定纯诊断论文 (C1-C7), 7 天完成写作\n384\t5. **论文收尾** — Reviewer 审查 + provenance 检查 + 三件套\n385\t\n386\t---\n387\t\n388\t## Key Figures (Planned)\n389\t\n390\t1. **Figure 1**: Learning curves — all experiments overlaid, showing degradation pattern (hero figure)\n391\t2. **Figure 2**: Value/eval ratio over training — separating healthy vs. pathological regimes\n392\t3. **Figure 3**: Factorial grid summary — 2×2 (dt_emb × subsample) with H as secondary axis\n393\t4. **Figure 4**: Causal diagram — dt_embedding → value overestimation → actor degradation → collapse\n394\t5. **Figure 5**: dt=1 vs dt=2 vs dt=4 comparison — monotonic degradation (C4)\n395\t6. **Table 1**: RSSM fidelity — absolute obs_MSE + reward_MAE at dt=1/dt=2, 三模型并排（绝对值 + 比率，避免比率误导）\n396\t7. **Figure 6 (D035)**: Mitigation comparison — plot 008e_v3 seed=1 as single line. Add s2 (seed=2) when done. Do NOT present s0+s1 as two independent seeds. Can footnote deterministic reproduction.\n397\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0f622056-2ff5-4120-89bf-462a99a98eb0","uuid":"48fbc0b5-45b1-434a-9e98-84230234efde","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:29:11.819Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T155150/best/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing: Diagnostic Analysis of Temporal Abstraction in World-Model RL\n\n## Title Candidates\n\n1. **\"Why Temporal Abstraction Fails in DreamerV3: A Diagnostic Analysis of Variable-Rate Imagination\"**\n2. ~~**\"The Delusional Critic Problem in DreamerV3's Variable-Rate Imagination\"**~~ (deprecated — \"delusional critic\" conflicts with Lu et al. 2018)\n3. **\"Diagnosing Value Overestimation from Temporal Abstraction in DreamerV3\"** ← preferred after D037 terminology decision\n4. **\"Conditioning-Induced Value Overestimation in Variable-Rate World-Model Imagination\"**\n\n**⚠️ D037 术语决定**: \"delusional critic\" → **\"conditioning-induced value overestimation\"** (简称 CIVO)。Lu et al. 2018 的 delusional bias 指 policy-class constraints 导致不可实现的 Q 值，本文机制是 model imprecision + learned conditioning amplification，概念不同。Dream 模拟三档审稿一致指出术语误导。全文替换：\"delusional critic\" → \"conditioning-induced value overestimation\"，可 cite Lu et al. 2018 as analogy but must explicitly differentiate。\n\n**⚠️ D037 TAWM 对比（关键 novelty 升级）**: TAWM (Nhu et al., ICML 2025) 在 TD-MPC2 (MPC setting) 中成功使用 dt-conditioning。本文发现 dt-conditioning 在 imagination-based actor-critic 中失败 → **novelty 从 \"known failure class 的 specific instance\" 升级为 \"dt-conditioning succeeds in MPC but fails in imagination — here's the architecture-specific vulnerability\"**。TAWM 是强化 novelty 的最关键参考文献。\n\n## Venue\n\n**CoRL 2026** — Deadline: 2026-05-29\n\n## Narrative Positioning\n\nThis is a **diagnostic analysis paper**, not a method paper. We do not propose a new algorithm. Instead, we provide a systematic, controlled investigation answering: *Why does temporal abstraction fail in world-model RL?*\n\nThe contribution is a **strongly supported causal chain** from mechanism to failure mode, backed by a factorial experiment design that isolates each factor, plus a **practical mitigation guideline** (restrict imagination to dt=1 during multi-dt training → 95% baseline recovery). Diagnostic papers are valued when they (a) address a widely-attempted but poorly-understood failure, (b) provide actionable insight for future method design, and (c) are methodologically rigorous.\n\nWe scope all claims to **DreamerV3 and its RSSM world model**. Generalizability to other latent-dynamics architectures is discussed but not claimed.\n\n---\n\n## Core Claims\n\n### C1: Variable-rate imagination in DreamerV3 consistently degrades performance\n\nTemporal abstraction via variable dt—whether learned or fixed—degrades asymptotic performance relative to the dt=1 baseline across all tested configurations.\n\n| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n|----------|-----------|------------|\n| Baseline stability | exp_001_baseline (dt=1) | Stable convergence ~950 eval return |\n| Fixed dt=2 collapse | exp_006_fixed_dt2 (dt=2, subsample ON, H=15) | Peak 485@35K → collapse to ~135@65K |\n| Fixed dt=4 severe degradation | exp_007_fixed_dt4 (dt=4) | Peak 176.9@25K, 144.4@45K (33% of baseline@45K=443) |\n| Learned gate collapse | exp_005 (learned gate) | Peak 541@55K → 99@145K |\n\n**Strength**: Strong. Three independent dt>1 configurations all show degradation. No positive result exists for variable-rate imagination in our setup.\n\n### C2: Trained dt_embedding reliably triggers pathological value overestimation (>1.5x), creating high collapse risk\n\n**D032 update: nve>1.5x threshold has perfect separating power (4/4); collapse itself is stochastic.**\n\nThe trained dt_embedding reliably induces pathological value overestimation (normalized v/e >1.5x baseline) across all tested seeds, but whether this overestimation progresses to catastrophic performance collapse is stochastic:\n\n- **WITH trained dt_emb**: 2/2 seeds exceed nve>1.5x at 35K+ (008d seed 1: sustained 1.71x@35K→2.09x@45K→4.12x@55K → collapse; 009b seed 2: 1.62x@45K → self-correction to 0.38x@105K)\n- **WITHOUT dt_emb (008f)**: 0/2 seeds exceed nve>1.5x at 35K+ (seed 1 peak 1.02x@25K; seed 2 peak 1.26x@25K)\n- **1.5x threshold (35K+)**: 4/4 perfect classification — reliable diagnostic marker separating trained vs untrained dt_emb\n\n**⚠️ 时间限定**: nve>1.5x 诊断适用于 **35K+ steps**（此时 baseline v/e 已充分收敛至 >0.24，比率稳定可靠）。25K 处 baseline v/e 仅 0.087，微小绝对差异可被放大为大比率（如 009b@25K nve=2.05x 和 008e_v3@25K nve=1.93x 均为 false positive）。论文中报告 threshold 时必须标注此限定。\n\n**Sustained vs transient overestimation**: The key difference between collapse (008d seed 1) and self-correction (009b seed 2) is the **temporal persistence** of nve>1.5x. Seed 1 maintained nve>1.5x across 3 consecutive checkpoints at 35K+ (1.71x@35K→2.09x@45K→4.12x@55K, accelerating), locking the positive feedback loop; seed 2 exceeded 1.5x at 45K (1.62x) but dropped to 1.41x@55K and continued declining, allowing self-correction. This suggests a \"point of no return\" where sustained overestimation becomes irreversible, with early training stochasticity (initialization, data sampling order) determining which path is taken (cf. Henderson et al. 2018, Bjorck et al. 2022, Qiao et al. 2023).\n\nThe trained dt_embedding enables precise dt prediction in imagination, but RSSM state prediction quality at dt>1 is insufficient to support this precision. The result is conditioning-induced value overestimation (CIVO) that drives actor learning toward incorrect policies. Without dt_embedding conditioning, the overestimation feedback loop is blocked entirely (nve never exceeds 1.5x).\n\n| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n|----------|-----------|------------|\n| Untrained dt_emb, no collapse | exp_008c (dt=2, subsample OFF, untrained dt_emb, H=8) | eval plateau ~242@55K; v/e: @35K=21.8% (0.90x) → @55K=29.1% (0.72x) → @65K=32.8% (0.58x) (declining normalized v/e, ~7x slower than trained) |\n| Trained dt_emb, collapse | exp_008d (dt=2, subsample ON, trained dt_emb, H=8) | eval declining 167→146→141 @25K→35K→45K; v/e: @25K=15.5% (1.78x) → @35K=41.2% (1.71x) → @45K=69.3% (2.09x) (accelerating overestimation) |\n| Both trained dt_emb → accelerating v/e | exp_006 (H=15) vs exp_008d (H=8) | 006: v/e @35K=31.1% (1.29x)→@45K=53.3% (1.61x)→@55K=93.3% (2.31x); 008d: v/e @35K=41.2% (1.71x)→@45K=69.3% (2.09x) — both show accelerating normalized v/e leading to collapse |\n| Baseline v/e calibration (overshoot reference) | exp_001_baseline | v/e@35K=24.1%, @45K=33.1%, @55K=40.4%. Overshoot ratio: 008d@35K=1.7x, @45K=2.1x; 006@45K=1.6x, @55K=2.3x (all >1.5x = pathological) |\n| **D032: Trained dt_emb seed 2 — pathological but self-correcting** | exp_009b (008d config, seed 2) | eval 39→141→164→141→172→209→197→236→279→268@105K (**no collapse**, rising). nve: **2.05x@25K**→1.24x→**1.62x@45K**→1.41x→0.94x→0.66x→0.51x→0.43x→**0.38x@105K**. Transient nve>1.5x with self-correction. Value peaked 110.9@65K → self-corrected to 67.3@105K while eval improved. |\n| **1.5x threshold separating power** | 008d+009b vs 008f+009c | WITH trained dt_emb: 2/2 seeds exceed nve>1.5x (008d peak 2.09x sustained, 009b peak 2.05x transient). WITHOUT dt_emb: 0/2 seeds exceed nve>1.5x (008f peak 1.02x, 009c peak 1.26x). **4/4 perfect classification.** |\n| **Causal control: dt_embed_dim=0 (direction confirmed, seed-dependent)** | exp_008f seed 1 + exp_009c seed 2 | **Seed 1**: eval 197→207→194→173→503@105K (zigzag recovery); nve 1.02x→0.73x→0.83x→0.97x→0.30x. **Seed 2**: eval 169→211→239→359→227→191→148@105K (decline after 75K); nve 1.26x→0.79x→0.72x→0.33x→0.60x→0.90x→1.14x. Both vs 008d@45K nve=2.09x: onset delayed 60K+ steps, severity reduced ~2x. **009c extending to 200K to observe if nve crosses 1.5x.** |\n| **Reward SGS = no-op (reward gradient = 0 by architecture)** | exp_016e (reward_dt_emb_detach=True, subsample ON, H=8, seed 1) | Peak eval 326.7@75K → collapse 31.7@95K, NVE=10.42x. 梯度验证揭示 reward loss 对 dt_emb.weight 贡献为 0——reward_dt_emb_detach 是 no-op。016e 与 008d 的差异（onset timing, peak height）归因于随机变异。**⚠️ 修正：reward head 贡献最大梯度（49%@55K），obs decoder 仅 16.3%。但 reward-only SGS 仍失败——梯度大小与因果重要性解耦。** |\n| RSSM fidelity analysis | baseline / 008d / 008f | See RSSM Fidelity Table below |\n\n**⚠️ 008f 定位：因果控制实验，非推荐方案。** 008f 去掉 dt_embedding 后 reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 的 75x），reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2（reward gap 仅 1.01x vs 008d 的 2.78x）。**D030 更新**：008f seed 2 (009c) 在 105K 达到 nve=1.14x（borderline），seed 1 为 0.30x——protection 不 robust。但 008f 两个 seed 的 v/e 增长速度均显著慢于 008d（008d@45K=2.09x vs 008f seed 2@105K=1.14x），确认 dt_embedding 是 primary amplifier。**C2 因果方向成立，但 \"eliminates\" 改为 \"significantly delays and reduces\"。推荐方案仍是 008e_v3（C6）**。\n\n**RSSM Fidelity Table（论文中必须同时报告绝对误差和比率）：**\n\n| Model | dt1 obs_MSE | dt2 obs_MSE | obs gap | dt1 reward_MAE | dt2 reward_MAE | reward gap |\n|-------|------------|------------|---------|---------------|---------------|------------|\n| baseline (exp_001) | 13.49 | 27.50 | **2.04x** | 0.0102 | 0.0159 | 1.56x |\n| 008d (trained dt_emb, collapsed) | 41.31 | 53.67 | **1.30x** | 0.0568 | 0.1579 | **2.78x** |\n| 008f (no dt_emb, stable) | 8.01 | 22.04 | **2.75x** | 0.7469 | 0.7526 | 1.01x |\n\n**解读要点**：008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30x) 具有误导性——其 dt=1 绝对误差本身已是 baseline 的 3x（模型已崩塌）。论文中必须并排呈现绝对误差和比率，避免审稿人被比率误导。\n\n**dt_emb Gradient Decomposition (D061) — ⚠️ 已修正**\n\n梯度验证（torch.autograd.grad analysis, correct config gate_fixed_dt=2）揭示 dt_emb.weight 的梯度来源分布：\n\n| Source | 55K (%) | 112K (%) |\n|--------|---------|----------|\n| Reward head | 49.0 | 38.1 |\n| KL dynamics | 34.7 | 40.4 |\n| Observation decoders | 16.3 | 21.5 |\n| Cont head | ~0 | ~0 |\n\n⚠️ **之前的 93% obs / 0% reward 数据不可复现**（见 gradient_decomposition_008d_corrected.json）。正确结论：reward head 贡献最大梯度（38-49%），但 reward-only SGS (016e) 仍然失败（NVE=10.42×）；obs decoder 通路（16-22%）虽贡献最小，但携带关键的 Δt-specific 空间信息驱动 RSSM fidelity gap。**梯度大小与因果重要性解耦**是核心发现。\n\n**Strength**: Moderate-strong (D032 update: causal direction + diagnostic marker confirmed; collapse stochastic). The **nve>1.5x threshold** achieves 4/4 perfect separation: all trained dt_emb seeds (008d, 009b) exceed 1.5x; no untrained seeds (008f, 009c) exceed 1.5x. This is the paper's strongest quantitative result for C2. **Collapse** is stochastic (1/2 trained seeds): 008d seed 1 shows sustained nve>1.5x → collapse; 009b seed 2 shows transient nve>1.5x → self-correction. The **causal direction** is unambiguous across all 4 data points. Pending: 009e (008d seed 1) to determine collapse probability (1/3 vs 2/3); 009f (008f seed 1) for third untrained seed; 009c extension to 200K.\n\n### C3: Untrained dt_embedding prevents optimistic drift, substantively protecting performance\n\nWhen dt_embedding is untrained (random fixed), the value function cannot exploit precise dt information, preventing the optimistic value drift seen in trained variants. This value growth suppression substantively protects performance: exp_008a demonstrates two complete zigzag recovery cycles over 105K steps (peak @105K=778, 85% of baseline 916), with normalized v/e consistently suppressed at 0.59-0.93x baseline. The trained dt_embedding variant (exp_006) collapses catastrophically as its v/e ratio accelerates far past baseline levels (2.3x baseline@55K).\n\n| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n|----------|-----------|------------|\n| Two V-shaped recoveries (105K) | exp_008a (dt=2, subsample OFF, untrained dt_emb, H=15) | 501→563→488→608→470→584→572→778; two complete recovery cycles over 105K steps. @65K=608 (-1.3% baseline), @105K=778 (-15.1% baseline, 85% of 916). No collapse. |\n| Sustained v/e suppression | exp_008a | v/e: 37.6%@55K → 37.2%@65K → 53.6%@75K → 47.5%@85K → 49.7%@95K → 38.6%@105K. Normalized v/e: 0.93x→0.66x→0.75x→0.68x→0.79x→0.59x baseline. Consistently below 1.0x, no acceleration. |\n| Trained dt_emb: accelerating collapse | exp_006 (dt=2, subsample ON, trained dt_emb, H=15) | 485→477→360→collapse; v/e: 53.3%@45K (1.61x)→93.3%@55K (2.31x) → immediate collapse |\n| v/e rate comparison (H=8 controlled) | exp_008c vs exp_008d | 008c (untrained): @35K=21.8% (0.90x)→@65K=32.8% (0.58x) (normalized declining); 008d (trained): @25K=15.5% (1.78x)→@35K=41.2% (1.71x) (normalized >1.5x = pathological). ~7x slower overestimation rate |\n| Baseline v/e calibration | exp_001_baseline | v/e: 8.7%@25K → 24.1%@35K → 40.4%@55K → 56.3%@65K → 65.6%@105K (stable 69-72% from 135K+). 008a normalized v/e: 0.93x@55K → 0.66x@65K → 0.59x@105K (suppressed, diverging further below baseline); 008d: 1.7x@35K → 2.1x@45K (optimistic drift) |\n\n**Strength**: Strong (B+ confirmed with 105K long-run data). Two complete zigzag recovery cycles (501→608→470→778) with normalized v/e consistently 0.59-0.93x baseline across 105K steps. This is structural value growth suppression, not a transient delay. Contrasts sharply with exp_006's accelerating v/e (1.6x→2.3x baseline → collapse). The mechanism is clear: untrained dt_embedding prevents the value function from exploiting precise (but wrong) dt>1 predictions, suppressing the optimistic value drift that drives the CIVO feedback loop in trained variants.\n\n**Diagnostic metric: v/e overshoot ratio** = experiment v/e / baseline v/e at same training step. >1.5x = pathological warning. Trained dt_emb variants: 008d@35K=1.7x, @45K=2.1x; 006@45K=1.6x, @55K=2.3x. Untrained: 008a normalized v/e range 0.59-0.93x over 55K-105K (consistently below baseline = healthy, diverging further from baseline over time).\n\n**105K long-run confirmed**: exp_008a ran to 112K steps. Normalized v/e at 105K=0.59x baseline (lowest point), confirming value growth suppression is structural, not a transient delay. The suppression strengthens over time rather than converging to baseline levels.\n\n### C4: Longer dt amplifies the problem\n\nIncreasing dt from 2 to 4 worsens degradation, consistent with RSSM prediction error compounding over longer temporal gaps.\n\n| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n|----------|-----------|------------|\n| dt=2 degradation | exp_006_fixed_dt2 | Peak 485, collapse to ~135 |\n| dt=4 severe degradation | exp_007_fixed_dt4 | Peak 176.9@25K, 144.4@45K (33% of baseline@45K=443) |\n| Monotonic relationship | dt=1 (~950) > dt=2 (peak 485@35K) > dt=4 (peak 177@25K) | Clear monotonic decline |\n\n**Strength**: Moderate. Only two dt values tested (2 and 4). The monotonic trend is clear but a finer grid (dt=3, dt=6) would strengthen this claim. Sufficient for a supporting claim but not a standalone finding.\n\n### C5: Learning signal reduction from shorter effective horizons compounds degradation but is not the root cause\n\nSubsampling with dt>1 reduces the effective number of learning transitions per episode. This contributes to degradation but is neither necessary nor sufficient for collapse.\n\n| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n|----------|-----------|------------|\n| Subsample OFF, still degraded | exp_008c (subsample OFF, untrained dt_emb, H=8) | eval ~242 vs baseline ~950 |\n| Subsample OFF, no collapse | exp_008a (subsample OFF, untrained dt_emb, H=15) | eval 778@105K (85% baseline), no collapse through 112K steps |\n| Subsample ON, collapse | exp_008d (subsample ON, trained dt_emb, H=8) | eval 146, value overestimation |\n| Horizon effect | exp_008c (H=8) vs exp_008a (H=15) | H=15 significantly outperforms H=8, both subsample OFF |\n| Subsample ON, trained dt_emb, dt=1 imag, no collapse | exp_008e_v3 (subsample ON, trained dt_emb, dt=1 imag, H=15) | eval 382@45K (86% baseline); normalized v/e 0.88x@45K (normal). Even with trained dt_emb and subsample ON, restricting imagination to dt=1 prevents collapse |\n\n**Strength**: Moderate. The 008c vs 008a comparison shows horizon length matters independently. exp_008e_v3 confirms subsample ON does not trigger collapse when imagination is restricted to dt=1, even with trained dt_emb. But disentangling horizon from subsample effects requires additional controls. The key point—that it's not the root cause—is well-supported by 008c's stability despite lower performance.\n\n### C6: dt=1 imagination delays but does not eliminate CIVO collapse — the vulnerability is the trained dt_embedding itself\n\n**⚠️ D038 重大修正**: 008e_v3_s2 (seed=2) **崩溃** — eval 715@95K → 452 → 137@105K, nve=3.78x@105K, 全程 gate_dt_mean=1.0（dt=1 imagination 从未违反）。\n\n原假设\"dt=1 imagination = practical mitigation\"被**否证**。跨 seed 数据：\n- seed 1: eval=869.9@105K ✓（95% baseline, nve=0.80x）\n- seed 2: eval=137@105K ✗（崩溃, nve=3.78x）\n- **独立 seed 崩溃率: 1/2 (50%)**\n\n对比 008d (trained dt_emb + dt=2 imagination): 同样 1/2 崩溃率（seed 1 collapse, seed 2 self-correct@268）。dt=1 imagination **未降低崩溃概率**。\n\n**⚠️ D039 机制辨析 — 008e_v3_s2 的崩溃可能不是 CIVO**\n\nReviewer 深度分析揭示 008e_v3_s2 与 008d 的崩溃动力学**定性不同**：\n\n| 特征 | 008d s1 (经典 CIVO) | 008e_v3_s2 (待确认) |\n|------|---------------------|---------------------|\n| value 变化 | 爆炸 (60→138, +130%@55K) | 温和 (339→384→340, +13%→-12%) |\n| eval 变化 | 后跌 (146→83, -43%) | **先跌** (715→452→137, -81%) |\n| nve 驱动 | value 分子驱动（value 爆炸） | eval 分母驱动（eval 崩溃） |\n| actor_entropy | ↓ (-3.47→-4.88) 策略变确定 | **↑** (-5.21→-3.83) 策略变随机 |\n| 机制 | critic overestimate → actor exploit | eval crash → value 滞后跟随 |\n\n**结论**: 008e_v3_s2 的 nve=3.78x 是 eval 崩溃的**结果**，不是 value overestimation 的**原因**。这更像 policy instability 而非 CIVO。\n\n**D040 最终判定**: 009a baseline seed 2 在 85-105K **完全稳定** (618→596→836, 正常波动后恢复)。排除 \"seed 2 本身不稳定\" 假说。**008e_v3_s2 的崩溃是配置导致的**。\n\n| Step | baseline s2 (009a) | 008e_v3 s2 | 差异 |\n|------|-------------------|------------|------|\n| 85K | 618.7 | 715.2 | 008e_v3 略高 |\n| 95K | 596.2 (↓3.6%) | 452.4 (**↓37%**) | 10× 更大跌幅 |\n| 105K | 836.5 (↑40%) | 137.0 (**↓70%**) | baseline 恢复 vs 008e_v3 继续崩 |\n\n**C6 最终状态: PARTIALLY FALSIFIED**\n- dt=1 imagination 不能阻止崩溃（008e_v3: 1/2 seeds 崩溃 vs baseline: 0/2 seeds 崩溃）\n- 崩溃是配置导致的，不是 seed 特异性\n- 但崩溃**机制**与经典 CIVO 不同（见上方对比表）→ trained dt_embedding 可能通过**多条路径**创造脆弱性\n\n**论文表述建议**: \"Restricting imagination to dt=1 does not prevent collapse in the presence of trained dt-embedding (1/2 seeds collapse). While the collapse shares the high nve signature with classic CIVO, the underlying dynamics differ — the collapsed seed exhibits eval-driven destabilization with increasing policy entropy, rather than value-driven exploitation with decreasing entropy. This suggests trained dt-embedding creates vulnerability through multiple pathways, not solely through the value overestimation feedback loop.\"\n\n| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n|----------|-----------|------------|\n| dt=1 imag, seed 1, healthy | exp_008e_v3_walker_s1 (trained dt_emb, dt=1 imag, H=15) | eval=869.9@105K (95% baseline), nve=0.80x |\n| **dt=1 imag, seed 2, COLLAPSED** | exp_008e_v3_walker_s2 (same config, seed=2) | eval 715@95K → 137@105K, nve ≤0.68x@85K → 1.34x@95K → **3.78x@105K**. gate_dt=1.0 throughout |\n| dt=2 imag, seed 1, collapsed | exp_008d (trained dt_emb, dt=2 imag, H=8) | eval 167→82@55K, nve 1.78x@25K → 2.09x@45K. Onset at 25K |\n| dt=2 imag, seed 2, self-corrected | exp_009b (008d config, seed 2) | eval 268@105K (rising), nve peak 1.62x@45K → self-correction |\n| Onset delay | 008e_v3_s2 vs 008d | 008d onset nve>1.5x at 25-35K; 008e_v3_s2 at 95-105K. Delay ~70K steps |\n| No dt_emb, stable | exp_008f (dt_embed_dim=0, subsample ON) | No collapse, reward_MAE 75x baseline |\n| Untrained dt_emb, stable | exp_008a (untrained, subsample OFF, H=15) | 778@105K (85% baseline), nve 0.59-0.93x |\n\n**Strength**: **Moderate (D040: PARTIALLY FALSIFIED)** — dt=1 imagination 不能阻止崩溃 (1/2 seeds)，但崩溃机制与经典 CIVO 不同 (eval-driven vs value-driven)。009a baseline s2 稳定排除 seed 脆弱假说。核心洞察：trained dt_embedding creates vulnerability through multiple pathways — CIVO (Pathway A, 008d) 和 non-CIVO policy instability (Pathway B, 008e_v3_s2)。dt=1 imagination 消除 Pathway A 但不消除 Pathway B。\n\n### C7: Gradient-level interventions fail to eliminate CIVO — gradient magnitude decoupled from causal importance\n\n**⚠️ D107: SGS 全面失败，梯度干预不是正确的干预层级**\n\nAll three SGS variants fail to eliminate CIVO:\n- **Reward-only SGS** (016e): 0/2, NVE=10.42× — paradoxically worse than untreated\n- **Full-pathway SGS** (018+021): 0/3 across two environments — blocks all non-KL gradients, still fails\n- **Obs-decoder-only SGS** (025+026): 1/6 across two environments — the identified causal channel, still fails\n\n| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n|----------|-----------|------------|\n| Reward-only SGS 反效果 | exp_016e | NVE=10.42×, collapse to eval 31.7. 阻断 reward 梯度迫使 dt_emb 通过 obs-decoder 适配，强化空间偏差 |\n| Full SGS 0/3 | exp_018 (Walker 2 seeds) + exp_021 (Cheetah 1 seed) | s1: eval 448.3, NVE 1.66× (CIVO+); s2: collapse 40.8; Cheetah: transient NVE 9.94×→0.34× (not SGS effect) |\n| Obs-decoder SGS 1/6 | exp_025 (Walker 4 seeds) + exp_026 (Cheetah 2 seeds) | Walker: 1/4 (s1 survived, s2-s4 collapsed); Cheetah: 0/2, NVE 21.9×-30.2× (2.6-3.6× worse than untreated 8.3×) |\n| Compensatory amplification (Cheetah) | exp_026 vs exp_010b | Obs-decoder SGS NVE 21.9-30.2× vs untreated 8.3× — blocking obs-decoder shifts co-adaptation to reward head |\n| Universal value collapse | exp_025 all seeds @215K | All 4 seeds terminal ve_ratio=0.056-0.14, including s1 \"success\" (eval 726, value 41) — critic underestimation as side effect |\n| Fourth trajectory (s3) | exp_025_s3 | Healthy@105K → CIVO@135K (NVE 6.8×) → eval recovery (590@215K) → persistent value collapse (ve_ratio 0.14) |\n\n**核心发现**：\n1. **梯度量级与因果重要性脱耦**: Reward head 38-49% 梯度占比（最大），但 reward-only SGS 失败最惨；obs decoder 16-22%（最小非零），但 obs-decoder SGS 也失败。梯度分解成功作为**诊断工具**但失败作为**干预指南**。\n2. **Backward-pass 是错误的干预层级**: Full SGS 阻断所有非 KL 梯度仍 0/3 → forward-pass representational damage 是不可约减的脆弱性底线。Temporal embedding 通过 forward pass 塑造潜在表示，无论哪些梯度更新它。\n3. **补偿放大**: 阻断任一通道导致剩余通道放大 co-adaptation（Cheetah: 2.6-3.6× 放大）。\n4. **SGS 副作用**: 即使\"成功\"的 seed 也遭受 critic 校准损坏（universal value collapse）。\n\n**Strength**: Strong. 17 seeds across 3 SGS variants and 2 environments. Only 1/17 avoids CIVO, and that seed still suffers value collapse. Embedding removal (008f+024b): 5/5 = 100% prevention. The contrast establishes gradient stopping as categorically insufficient.\n\n### C8: Forward-pass interventions — TCN and RAVE (🔄 验证中)\n\n**⚠️ D107/D108: 两种 forward-pass 干预方法并行验证**\n\nSGS 失败的根因是 backward-pass 干预无法消除 forward-pass representational damage。C8 提出绕过梯度冗余的 forward-pass 干预：\n\n**TCN (Temporal Conditioning Noise)**:\n- 设计理念：imagination 时对 dt_embedding 输出加高斯噪声 $\\mathcal{N}(0, \\sigma^2)$，降低 conditioning 精度\n- 机制假说：噪声阻止 RSSM 和 critic 对精确 dt 信号的过度 co-adaptation，同时保留粗粒度时间信息\n- 与 SGS 的区别：在 forward pass 层面操作，不依赖梯度阻断\n- 超参：σ=0.5×std（主实验）+ σ=0.2×std（替代超参）\n- 实验：exp_027_tcn_walker_s0 (σ=0.5), exp_027_tcn_walker_s0_sigma02 (σ=0.2)\n\n**RAVE (Reality-Anchored Value Estimation)**:\n- 设计理念：用 EMA 跟踪真实环境状态的值估计，当 imagined value 超过 EMA×ceiling 时截断\n- 机制假说：直接限制 critic overestimation 的幅度，打断 CIVO 正反馈循环\n- 与 SGS 的区别：不修改梯度流，而是在 value estimate 层面施加约束\n- 超参：ceiling=2.0（主实验）+ ceiling=1.5（替代超参）\n- 实验：exp_028_rave_walker_s0 (ceil=2.0), exp_028_rave_walker_s0_ceil15 (ceil=1.5)\n\n**D109 GO — 结果更新 (2026-05-20)**:\n\n**TCN σ=0.2 Walker s0 (215K) ✅ — 全项目首个完全预防 CIVO 的干预**:\n- NVE 全程 < 1.0×（峰值 0.908@95K，末期 0.095@215K）\n- eval 峰值 821.1@175K（90% baseline），末期均值 587\n- 保持基线竞争性能 + 零 CIVO → 前向精度降解假说验证\n\n**TCN σ=0.5 Walker 2 seeds ❌ — 过量噪声 → 振荡双稳态**:\n- s0: NVE 峰值 4.0, eval 峰值 366（40% baseline）\n- s1: NVE 峰值 1.637, eval 峰值 365（40% baseline）\n- 跨 seed 定性一致：振荡 CIVO + 永久性能损伤 → σ 过大破坏有用时间信息\n\n**RAVE 2 配置 ❌ — EMA anchor 自身污染**:\n- ceil=2.0: negative（具体数据 TBD）\n- ceil=1.5: negative（具体数据 TBD）\n- 机制：CIVO 早期 imagined values 已偏高，EMA 跟踪这些值 → anchor 被污染 → ceiling 无效\n\n**Cheetah σ=0.2 ❌ — 剂量不足**:\n- NVE=1.903@55K（刚过 1.5× 阈值）\n- Cheetah CIVO 严重程度 8-108× vs Walker 2-6× → σ=0.2 噪声幅度不足\n\n**⚠️ Claim 措辞**: 用 \"NVE remained below 1.0× throughout\" 而非 \"零 CIVO\"。范围限制为 \"Walker Walk, σ=0.2\" 直到 s1 和 Cheetah σ=0.5 数据到手。\n\n| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\n|----------|-----------|------------|\n| TCN σ=0.5 s0 | exp_027_tcn_walker_s0 | ❌ NVE peak 4.0, eval peak 366 (40% baseline), oscillatory CIVO |\n| TCN σ=0.5 s1 | exp_027_tcn_walker_s1 | ❌ NVE peak 1.637, eval peak 365, oscillatory CIVO |\n| TCN σ=0.2 s0 | exp_027_tcn_walker_s0_sigma02 | ✅ NVE < 1.0× throughout (peak 0.908@95K), eval peak 821 (90% baseline) |\n| TCN σ=0.2 s1 | exp_027_tcn_walker_s1_sigma02 | 🔄 RUNNING |\n| RAVE ceiling=2.0 | exp_028_rave_walker_s0 | ❌ negative, EMA anchor polluted |\n| RAVE ceiling=1.5 | exp_028_rave_walker_s0_ceil15 | ❌ negative, same mechanism |\n| Cheetah TCN σ=0.2 | exp_027_tcn_cheetah_s0_sigma02 | ❌ NVE=1.903@55K, dose insufficient for Cheetah severity |\n| Cheetah TCN σ=0.5 | — | 🔄 RUNNING |\n\n**D109 GO**: TCN σ=0.2 Walker s0 成功 → C8 confirmed for Walker. 等待 s1 + Cheetah σ=0.5。\n\n**Strength**: Moderate-strong (single seed). σ=0.2 on Walker = first successful CIVO prevention with competitive performance. Dose-response (σ=0.5 fails, σ=0.2 succeeds) provides mechanistic insight. Cross-environment generalization pending.\n\n---\n\n## Story Arc\n\n### 1. Introduction\n- Temporal abstraction is a long-sought goal in RL (options, macro-actions, skip connections)\n- World-model RL (DreamerV3) offers a natural testbed: modify imagination dt without changing environment interaction\n- Puzzle: all our attempts at variable-rate imagination degrade performance. Why?\n- Contribution: systematic factorial diagnosis identifying trained dt_embedding as the reliable trigger for conditioning-induced value overestimation (CIVO, nve>1.5x), with collapse as a stochastic consequence. The vulnerability is deeper than imagination quality — even dt=1 imagination collapses at the same rate when dt_embedding is trained, revealing that training data dt>1 transitions alone drive the critic exploitation feedback loop\n\n### 2. Background & Related Work\n- Temporal abstraction in model-free RL (options framework, FiGAR, action repeat)\n- World-model RL (Dreamer family, IRIS, TWM)\n- Variable-rate planning in world models (few prior works, mostly positive framing)\n- Value overestimation in model-based RL (delusional bias per Lu et al. 2018 — differentiate from our CIVO)\n\n### 3. Methodology\n- DreamerV3 as base architecture\n- Variable-rate imagination: dt_embedding, temporal subsampling, learned gating\n- **Factorial experiment design**: 2×2×2 grid (dt_embedding trained/untrained × subsample ON/OFF × H=8/15) + baselines\n- Diagnostic metrics: eval return, value/eval ratio as overestimation proxy, learning curves\n\n### 4. Results\n- **Finding 1**: All dt>1 configurations degrade (C1)\n- **Finding 2**: Controlled ablation isolates trained dt_embedding (C2) — the \"smoking gun\" comparison (008c vs 008d)\n- **Finding 3**: Untrained dt_embedding prevents optimistic drift, sustaining near-baseline performance (C3)\n- **Finding 4**: Longer dt amplifies (C4)\n- **Finding 5**: Horizon/subsample effects are secondary (C5)\n- **Finding 6 (partially falsified)**: dt=1 imagination does not prevent collapse (1/2 seeds), but collapsed seed (008e_v3_s2) shows non-CIVO dynamics (eval-driven, entropy ↑) unlike 008d's classic CIVO (value-driven, entropy ↓). 009a baseline s2 stable → collapse is config-caused. Trained dt_embedding creates vulnerability through multiple pathways, not solely through value overestimation (C6, D040)\n\n### 5. Discussion\n- Mechanism: why trained dt_embedding causes CIVO (RSSM fidelity gap at dt>1)\n- RSSM fidelity analysis: 008d reward gap (2.78x) vs 008f reward gap (1.01x)\n- **D040: Multiple vulnerability pathways**: Pathway A (CIVO, value-driven) + Pathway B (non-CIVO policy instability, eval-driven)\n- **D107: Gradient-level interventions fail entirely**: SGS 0/3 (full) + 1/6 (obs-decoder) + 0/2 (reward-only) = backward-pass is categorically insufficient. Gradient magnitude ≠ causal importance (reward 38-49% but reward-only SGS fails worst; obs-decoder 16-22% but targeted SGS also fails). Forward-pass representational damage is the irreducible floor.\n- **Compensatory amplification**: Blocking obs-decoder on Cheetah → 2.6-3.6× NVE amplification vs untreated. Blocking reward → obs-decoder reliance increases → spatial bias reinforced.\n- **Universal value collapse**: Obs-decoder SGS degrades all seeds' critic calibration (ve_ratio 0.056-0.14 @215K), including CIVO-free seeds. \"Protection\" = trading overestimation for underestimation.\n- **Fourth CIVO trajectory (s3)**: Latent onset → delayed collapse → policy recovery → persistent value collapse. CIVO-induced critic damage may be irreversible.\n- MPC vs imagination: TAWM succeeds because MPC re-plans from real states; imagination-based critic bootstrapping creates the positive feedback loop\n- **D032: Value self-correction mechanism (009b)**: Transient vs sustained nve>1.5x determines outcome. Early stochasticity (initialization, data sampling) is the gate.\n\n### 6. Implications for Future Work\n- **D107: Forward-pass interventions are the next frontier**: Backward-pass (gradient) interventions exhaustively shown insufficient. Two forward-pass approaches under test:\n  - **TCN**: Imagination-time noise on dt_embedding to reduce conditioning precision\n  - **RAVE**: EMA-anchored value ceiling to directly limit critic overestimation\n- **D108 硬截止**: 5/22 go/no-go, 5/25 数据锁定. If both fail → pure diagnostic paper (still strong: C1-C7)\n- RSSM prediction quality must improve before variable-rate imagination is viable\n- Hierarchical temporal abstraction (THICK, Hieros) may avoid flat-conditioning failure by maintaining separate dynamics per temporal scale\n- Need for diagnostic methodology in temporal abstraction research\n\n---\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n### R1: \"Limited to one environment / one base algorithm\"\n**Pre-emption**: Our claims are mechanistic (trained dt_embedding → value overestimation → collapse). The causal chain is architecture-specific by design—we diagnose *why* it fails in DreamerV3, not whether it fails everywhere. The mechanism (RSSM fidelity gap) likely generalizes to other latent-dynamics models but we scope claims conservatively.\n**Mitigation**: Cheetah Run is a planned experiment in our experiment schedule, not a stretch goal. We will include at least one additional DMC environment (Cheetah Run) to demonstrate generality of the mechanism.\n\n### R2: \"No proposed solution — what's the actionable takeaway?\"\n**Pre-emption**: Our primary contribution is diagnostic, not prescriptive. The causal chain (C1-C5) provides clear guidance: trained dt_embedding is the necessary condition for CIVO. Restricting imagination to dt=1 eliminates CIVO (Pathway A) but not all failure modes — 008e_v3 shows 1/2 seeds collapse via a distinct non-CIVO pathway (eval-driven policy instability). The actionable takeaway is that trained dt_embedding creates vulnerability through multiple pathways in imagination-based actor-critic; surface-level fixes are insufficient. Hierarchical approaches (THICK, Hieros) that avoid flat dt-conditioning are the recommended direction.\n**Mitigation**: Present the dual-pathway finding as a key diagnostic contribution (Section 5). dt=1 imagination is a partial mitigation (eliminates CIVO) but not robust (1/2 collapse via Pathway B).\n\n### R3: \"Value/eval ratio is a crude proxy for overestimation\"\n**Pre-emption**: We acknowledge this is a proxy, not a formal divergence measure. However, the v/e overshoot ratio (experiment v/e / baseline v/e at same step) consistently identifies pathological overestimation: trained dt_emb variants exceed 1.5x baseline v/e before collapse, while untrained variants stay at or below baseline levels.\n**Mitigation**: Add distributional analysis of value predictions vs. realized returns if time permits.\n\n### R4: \"The factorial design is incomplete — missing cells in the grid\"\n**Pre-emption**: We prioritized the most informative comparisons. The 008c vs 008d pair isolates dt_embedding training with all else held constant—this is the critical controlled experiment.\n**Mitigation**: Explicitly present the factorial grid, mark which cells are filled, and justify the prioritization.\n\n### R5: \"Novelty concern — model exploitation / value overestimation in MBRL is well-known\"\n**Pre-emption**: General MBRL overestimation is known (Janner et al., 2019), but the specific mechanism through temporal abstraction's dt_embedding is novel. Prior work on temporal abstraction in world models has not identified this failure mode. Our contribution is the *specific causal link*, not the general phenomenon.\n\n### R6: \"All results from a single seed — how robust are the conclusions?\"\n**Pre-emption (D032 update)**: Multi-seed data now available. The nve>1.5x diagnostic threshold achieves **4/4 perfect classification** across seeds: trained dt_emb (008d seed 1, 009b seed 2) both exceed 1.5x; untrained (008f seed 1, 009c seed 2) neither exceeds 1.5x. Collapse itself is stochastic (1/2 trained seeds), which we report transparently — our claim is about the reliable **diagnostic marker** (nve>1.5x), not deterministic collapse.\n**[D040]** C6 partially falsified: 008e_v3_s2 collapsed via non-CIVO pathway (eval-driven, entropy ↑). 009a baseline s2 stable (618→596→836) — rules out seed fragility. Trained dt_embedding creates multiple vulnerability pathways: CIVO (Pathway A, 008d) and policy instability (Pathway B, 008e_v3_s2). dt=1 imagination eliminates Pathway A but not B.\n**Mitigation**: Report all seeds with IQM + confidence intervals per Agarwal et al. (2021). The 4/4 separation is robust. Additional seeds (009e, 009f) pending to further narrow collapse probability estimates.\n\n### R7: \"The factorial design confounds dt_embedding training with training data composition\"\n**Pre-emption**: exp_008f confirmed: dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON → normalized v/e 0.83x@45K (healthy), vs 008d@45K=2.09x (collapse at v/e=69.3%). This confirms dt_embedding conditioning—not RSSM learned dynamics—is the causal mechanism. exp_008f uses identical training data composition as 008d (subsample ON, dt=2 transitions) but removes dt_embedding conditioning. Through 55K, 008f remained in normal range (normalized v/e 0.73-1.02x).\n**Mitigation**: The 008f causal control resolves this confound definitively. The three-way comparison (008c: subsample OFF/untrained, 008d: subsample ON/trained, 008f: subsample ON/no dt_embed) isolates dt_embedding conditioning as the necessary and sufficient factor for CIVO.\n\n### R8: \"008f reward prediction degradation undermines the causal control\"\n**Pre-emption**: 008f 的 reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75x）是重要发现，但不削弱 C2 因果结论。008f 证明的是\"去掉 dt_embedding → 不崩塌\"，这个 collapse vs no-collapse 的区分不依赖 reward 质量。008f 的低 v/e 部分源于奖励噪声，但关键对比是 008d 的 v/e 加速发散 vs 008f 的 v/e 保持稳定——模式差异才是因果证据。\n**Mitigation**: 论文中明确区分 008f 的角色（因果控制实验）和 008e_v3 的角色（诊断证据：dt=1 imagination 不能消除 CIVO）。RSSM fidelity 表同时报告绝对误差和比率，避免审稿人被 008d 的低 obs gap ratio（1.30x，但绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 3x）误导。\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Coverage Assessment\n\n| Claim | Evidence Status | Gaps |\n|-------|----------------|------|\n| C1 (degradation) | ✅ Strong — 3 configurations + 2 environments | None |\n| C2 (CIVO trigger) | ✅ Strong — nve≥1.5× threshold 15/16, AUROC=0.969 (2 envs) | None |\n| C3 (untrained emb protection) | ✅ Strong — 008a + cross-env replication | None |\n| C4 (dt amplification) | ✅ Moderate — dt=1 > dt=2 > dt=4 monotonic | Only 2 dt values |\n| C5 (horizon/subsample secondary) | ✅ Moderate | None blocking |\n| C6 (dt=1 imag partial) | ✅ 4 seeds — 2/4 collapse via distinct pathways (CIVO + IRD) | None |\n| C7 (SGS failure / gradient decoupling) | ✅ Strong — 17 seeds, 3 variants, 2 envs. 1/17 CIVO-free (with value collapse side effect). Embedding removal 5/5. | None |\n| C8 (forward-pass intervention) | 🔄 RUNNING — TCN + RAVE, 4 configs | Results by 5/22 go/no-go |\n\n### Priority Actions Before Submission (updated 2026-05-20)\n1. ~~C1-C7 实验~~ — ✅ 全部完成，31 configurations, 2 environments\n2. **🔄 [P0] TCN/RAVE 结果评估** — exp_027 + exp_028, 硬截止 5/22 go/no-go\n3. **如 TCN 或 RAVE 有效** → 多 seed + Cheetah 扩展, 5/25 数据锁定\n4. **如两者均无效** → 锁定纯诊断论文 (C1-C7), 7 天完成写作\n5. **论文收尾** — Reviewer 审查 + provenance 检查 + 三件套\n\n---\n\n## Key Figures (Planned)\n\n1. **Figure 1**: Learning curves — all experiments overlaid, showing degradation pattern (hero figure)\n2. **Figure 2**: Value/eval ratio over training — separating healthy vs. pathological regimes\n3. **Figure 3**: Factorial grid summary — 2×2 (dt_emb × subsample) with H as secondary axis\n4. **Figure 4**: Causal diagram — dt_embedding → value overestimation → actor degradation → collapse\n5. **Figure 5**: dt=1 vs dt=2 vs dt=4 comparison — monotonic degradation (C4)\n6. **Table 1**: RSSM fidelity — absolute obs_MSE + reward_MAE at dt=1/dt=2, 三模型并排（绝对值 + 比率，避免比率误导）\n7. **Figure 6 (D035)**: Mitigation comparison — plot 008e_v3 seed=1 as single line. Add s2 (seed=2) when done. Do NOT present s0+s1 as two independent seeds. Can footnote deterministic reproduction.\n","numLines":397,"startLine":1,"totalLines":397}}}
